{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XErE3qu2tNmNT9JmztWduq","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '核心因果链（trained dt_emb → CIVO → collapse）作为 universal mechanism\n2\t  不成立—— 可能是 Walker Walk + RSSM 的特异性现象，而非 imagination-based AC 的通用漏洞。 Reframe 方向（仍冲\n3\t  CoRL）：从 \"mechanism paper\" 转为 \"methodology paper\"—— 贡献不是 CIVO 本身，而是 factorial diagnosis\n4\t  + NVE monitoring + gradient decomposition 的诊断方法论。 关键失败点：Cheetah 控制实验 NVE > 2.0×（跨环境因果控制失败）；008f_s3\n5\t  NVE > 1.5×（untrained dt_emb 保护被否证）； NVE 1.5× 阈值分类精度 < 75%。35pp decomposition 被 confound\n6\t  with SGS side effects。\n7\t\n8\t  '\n9\timagined_experiments:\n10\t- name: Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\n11\t  plan_id: plan_011\n12\t  description: Replicate delusional critic collapse with 2 more seeds (009e seed 1,\n13\t    009b seed 2)\n14\t  expected_results:\n15\t    seed1_collapse: true\n16\t    seed1_nve_peak: 4.12\n17\t    seed1_nve_peak_step: 55000\n18\t    seed1_eval_final_105K: 131\n19\t    seed2_collapse: false\n20\t    seed2_nve_peak: 2.05\n21\t    seed2_nve_peak_step: 25000\n22\t    seed2_eval_final_105K: 268\n23\t    seed2_self_correction: true\n24\t    collapse_rate: 0.5\n25\t    nve_exceeds_1_5x_rate: 1.0\n26\t  result_rationale: '已有数据（009e collapsed NVE 4.12×@55K; 009b self-corrected NVE 2.05×→0.38×）。\n27\t    在 worst 档，这些结果本身成立，但 1/2 崩溃率意味着 CIVO 不是确定性的—— 仅是一个随机事件。当 Cheetah 的 dt_embed_dim=0\n28\t    控制也出现 NVE>2.0× 时， Walker Walk 的 1/2 崩溃率变得不具说服力：究竟是 trained dt_emb 引起的， 还是配置组合的随机脆弱性？审稿人将质疑\n29\t    n=2 的统计功效。\n30\t\n31\t    '\n32\t  tables:\n33\t  - title: 008d cross-seed comparison\n34\t    columns:\n35\t    - seed\n36\t    - nve_peak\n37\t    - nve_peak_step\n38\t    - eval_105K\n39\t    - collapse\n40\t    - mechanism\n41\t    rows:\n42\t    - - 0(=009e)\n43\t      - 4.12\n44\t      - 55K\n45\t      - 131\n46\t      - true\n47\t      - value-driven CIVO\n48\t    - - 2(=009b)\n49\t      - 2.05\n50\t      - 25K\n51\t      - 268\n52\t      - false\n53\t      - transient→self-correction\n54\t  figures_description:\n55\t  - 'NVE trajectory overlay: seed 0 accelerating to 4.12× vs seed 2 transient spike\n56\t    then monotone decline'\n57\t  analysis: '崩溃率 50% 在 worst 档下不足以支持 mechanism claim——reviewer 会说这是 \"coin flip\" 而非\n58\t    \"reliable trigger\"。NVE>1.5× threshold 在 Walker Walk 内部仍有 4/4 separation， 但当 Cheetah\n59\t    控制实验也出现高 NVE 时，这个 threshold 的跨环境泛化性崩溃。\n60\t\n61\t    '\n62\t- name: Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\n63\t  plan_id: plan_012\n64\t  description: Replicate causal control stability — 008f_s3 (third seed) 是关键\n65\t  expected_results:\n66\t    seed1_009f_status: killed_no_data\n67\t    seed2_009c_eval_105K: 148.34\n68\t    seed2_009c_nve_105K: 1.14\n69\t    seed3_008f_s3_eval_peak: 280\n70\t    seed3_008f_s3_eval_105K: 165\n71\t    seed3_008f_s3_nve_peak: 1.72\n72\t    seed3_008f_s3_nve_peak_step: 85000\n73\t    seed3_exceeds_1_5x: true\n74\t    protection_falsified: true\n75\t    classification_accuracy_post_s3: 0.71\n76\t  result_rationale: 'Worst 档核心假设：008f_s3 NVE > 1.5×。机制：在 dt_embed_dim=0 条件下， RSSM\n77\t    仍需处理 dt=2 transitions（subsample ON），reward head 无法区分 dt=1/dt=2 （reward gap 1.01×），但\n78\t    observation decoder 的 dt=2 误差累积在某些 seed 下 仍可通过 critic 误导 actor。009c 已在 105K 达到\n79\t    NVE=1.14×（borderline）， 008f_s3 在更长 run 或不同初始化下跨越 1.5×。这不是经典 CIVO（无 dt_emb amplification），\n80\t    而是 \"raw RSSM fidelity gap\" 本身的有限 value overestimation——但它破坏了 NVE 1.5× 作为 trained\n81\t    vs untrained dt_emb 的 perfect separator 的故事。\n82\t\n83\t    '\n84\t  tables:\n85\t  - title: 008f (no dt_emb) all seeds NVE summary\n86\t    columns:\n87\t    - seed\n88\t    - nve_peak\n89\t    - nve_peak_step\n90\t    - exceeds_1.5x\n91\t    - eval_105K\n92\t    rows:\n93\t    - - 0\n94\t      - 1.02\n95\t      - 25K\n96\t      - false\n97\t      - 503\n98\t    - - 2(009c)\n99\t      - 1.14\n100\t      - 105K\n101\t      - false\n102\t      - 148\n103\t    - - 3(008f_s3)\n104\t      - 1.72\n105\t      - 85K\n106\t      - 'YES'\n107\t      - 165\n108\t  figures_description:\n109\t  - 'NVE trajectory: three 008f seeds overlaid, with 1.5× threshold line — s3 crosses\n110\t    threshold'\n111\t  analysis: '008f_s3 跨越 NVE 1.5× 是 worst 档的核心打击点。此前 4/4 perfect separation （trained\n112\t    2/2 exceed, untrained 0/2 exceed）变为 5/7 imperfect separation （trained 2/2+009e+009b=4/4\n113\t    exceed, untrained 1/3 exceed = 008f_s3）。 分类精度从 100% 降至 ~71%（5/7 correct）。审稿人将质疑：如果没有\n114\t    dt_emb 也能出现 NVE>1.5×，那么 trained dt_emb 真的是 \"necessary condition\" 吗？ 或仅是 \"amplifier\"？这削弱了整个\n115\t    C2 因果链从 \"necessary and sufficient\" 到 \"risk factor\"。\n116\t\n117\t    '\n118\t- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 (mitigation) seeds 1-2\n119\t  plan_id: plan_014\n120\t  description: Multi-seed validation of dt=1 imagination mitigation\n121\t  expected_results:\n122\t    seed1_eval_105K: 869.9\n123\t    seed1_nve_105K: 0.8\n124\t    seed1_collapse: false\n125\t    seed2_eval_105K: 137.0\n126\t    seed2_nve_105K: 3.78\n127\t    seed2_collapse: true\n128\t    seed2_mechanism: eval_driven_not_CIVO\n129\t    collapse_rate: 0.5\n130\t    mitigation_reliability: unreliable\n131\t  result_rationale: '已有数据确认（s1 成功 95% baseline, s2 崩溃 via non-CIVO pathway）。 在 worst\n132\t    档，这个 50% 崩溃率与 008d 的 50% 完全相同——dt=1 imagination 作为 mitigation 零效果。更糟的是 s2 的崩溃机制（eval-driven,\n133\t    entropy ↑） 与经典 CIVO 不同，被 reviewer 视为 \"ad hoc dual-pathway explanation\" 而非 genuine\n134\t    insight。审稿人评价：\"claiming two distinct pathways from n=2 per pathway is unfalsifiable\n135\t    post-hoc rationalization.\"\n136\t\n137\t    '\n138\t  tables:\n139\t  - title: 008e_v3 cross-seed collapse comparison\n140\t    columns:\n141\t    - seed\n142\t    - eval_105K\n143\t    - nve_105K\n144\t    - collapse\n145\t    - pathway\n146\t    - entropy_direction\n147\t    rows:\n148\t    - - 1\n149\t      - 869.9\n150\t      - 0.8\n151\t      - false\n152\t      - '-'\n153\t      - stable\n154\t    - - 2\n155\t      - 137.0\n156\t      - 3.78\n157\t      - true\n158\t      - Pathway B (eval-driven)\n159\t      - ↑ -5.21→-3.83\n160\t  figures_description:\n161\t  - 'Dual-panel: s1 healthy monotone rise vs s2 late-onset collapse with diverging\n162\t    entropy'\n163\t  analysis: 'Dual-pathway 在 worst 档被视为 ad hoc。Reviewer 核心批评： \"Two pathways from two\n164\t    seeds is curve-fitting, not science. Show me 10 seeds with clear bimodal distribution,\n165\t    or this is just noise.\" 50% collapse rate means dt=1 imagination provides zero\n166\t    marginal safety over dt=2 imagination (008d also 50%). The entire C6 story collapses\n167\t    into \"trained dt_emb is bad, and we have no mitigation.\"\n168\t\n169\t    '\n170\t- name: Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\n171\t  plan_id: plan_013\n172\t  description: Replicate value growth suppression with 2 more seeds\n173\t  expected_results:\n174\t    seed1_eval_105K: 520\n175\t    seed1_nve_range:\n176\t    - 0.55\n177\t    - 0.95\n178\t    seed1_collapse: false\n179\t    seed1_recovery_pattern: single_dip_recovery\n180\t    seed2_eval_105K: 380\n181\t    seed2_nve_peak: 1.35\n182\t    seed2_nve_peak_step: 75000\n183\t    seed2_collapse: false\n184\t    seed2_pattern: slow_decline_after_peak\n185\t    cross_seed_consistency: moderate\n186\t    vs_baseline_mean: -48%\n187\t  result_rationale: '008a 的 \"untrained dt_emb\" 实际是 trained dt_emb unexposed to dt>1\n188\t    data （subsample OFF = 所有训练数据都是 dt=1）。在 worst 档，seed 间变异大： seed 0 达到 778（85% baseline），但\n189\t    seed 1/2 可能仅达到 380-520（40-57% baseline）。 V-recovery pattern 不稳定复现——有的 seed 单次\n190\t    dip，有的缓慢下滑。 NVE 保持 <1.5× 但绝对性能远低于 baseline，reviewer 质疑： \"suppressed v/e is not\n191\t    suppressed degradation — 008a still loses 48% performance, making it useless as\n192\t    mitigation.\" 这削弱了 C3 从 \"protection\" 到 \"delayed failure\"。\n193\t\n194\t    '\n195\t  tables:\n196\t  - title: 008a cross-seed summary\n197\t    columns:\n198\t    - seed\n199\t    - eval_105K\n200\t    - vs_baseline_pct\n201\t    - nve_peak\n202\t    - collapse\n203\t    - pattern\n204\t    rows:\n205\t    - - 0\n206\t      - 778\n207\t      - -15%\n208\t      - 0.93\n209\t      - false\n210\t      - zigzag recovery\n211\t    - - 1\n212\t      - 520\n213\t      - -43%\n214\t      - 0.95\n215\t      - false\n216\t      - single dip recovery\n217\t    - - 2\n218\t      - 380\n219\t      - -59%\n220\t      - 1.35\n221\t      - false\n222\t      - slow decline post-peak\n223\t  figures_description:\n224\t  - Three-seed 008a eval curves showing high inter-seed variance; all below baseline\n225\t    but no collapse\n226\t  analysis: 'C3 核心 claim 是 \"untrained dt_emb prevents optimistic drift\" — 这在 worst\n227\t    档仍成立 （NVE < 1.5×），但 practical value 被质疑。平均 -48% vs baseline 意味着 \"preventing collapse\n228\t    by preventing learning\" — reviewer 评价： \"You''ve shown that removing information\n229\t    prevents exploitation, which is trivially true.\"\n230\t\n231\t    '\n232\t- name: Walker Walk FROZEN dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=2 imag + H=8\n233\t  plan_id: plan_015\n234\t  description: Frozen dt_embedding (requires_grad=False), 诊断 dt_emb TRAINING 是否是必要条件\n235\t  expected_results:\n236\t    eval_105K: 204\n237\t    nve_peak: 0.47\n238\t    nve_105K: 0.42\n239\t    collapse: false\n240\t    actor_loss_105K: 0.000179\n241\t    mechanism: gradient_starvation\n242\t    gate_dt_mean: 2.0\n243\t    comparison_vs_008d: no collapse but severe underperformance\n244\t    comparison_vs_008f: similar non-collapse but different mechanism\n245\t  result_rationale: '已有 exp_015b 数据：NVE 0.39-0.47（远低于 1.0，critic 低估），actor_loss→0\n246\t    （gradient starvation），eval 80-238 高波动无稳定收敛。在 worst 档， 这个结果被 reviewer 视为 confounding：frozen\n247\t    dt_emb 不崩溃是因为 gradient starvation 阻止了所有学习，不是因为 dt_emb training 是 CIVO 的原因。 \"You\n248\t    prevented CIVO by preventing learning entirely — this doesn''t isolate the mechanism.\"\n249\t    与 008f（dt_embed_dim=0）的区别不清晰：两者都不崩溃，但原因可能完全不同 （015b = gradient starvation; 008f\n250\t    = no conditioning information）。\n251\t\n252\t    '\n253\t  tables:\n254\t  - title: Frozen dt_emb vs controls\n255\t    columns:\n256\t    - config\n257\t    - eval_105K\n258\t    - nve_peak\n259\t    - mechanism\n260\t    - informative_for_C2\n261\t    rows:\n262\t    - - 015b (frozen)\n263\t      - 204\n264\t      - 0.47\n265\t      - gradient starvation\n266\t      - confounded\n267\t    - - 008d (trained)\n268\t      - 131\n269\t      - 4.12\n270\t      - CIVO\n271\t      - yes (positive control)\n272\t    - - 008f (dim=0)\n273\t      - 503\n274\t      - 1.02\n275\t      - no conditioning\n276\t      - yes (negative control)\n277\t  figures_description:\n278\t  - 'Three-way comparison: 008d collapse, 008f zigzag recovery, 015b flat low-performance'\n279\t  analysis: '015b 在 worst 档被视为 uninformative control。Reviewer 评价： \"Freezing the embedding\n280\t    creates a fundamentally different learning regime (gradient starvation in actor)\n281\t    — you cannot conclude that training is the causal factor when your intervention\n282\t    has multiple confounded effects.\" 2×2 消融矩阵（trained/frozen × exposed/unexposed）的\n283\t    frozen row 全部被 gradient starvation 污染，无法干净解读。\n284\t\n285\t    '\n286\t- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 additional seeds (seed 3-4)\n287\t  plan_id: plan_016\n288\t  description: Narrow true collapse probability of dt=1 imagination config\n289\t  expected_results:\n290\t    seed3_eval_105K: 780\n291\t    seed3_nve_105K: 0.72\n292\t    seed3_collapse: false\n293\t    seed4_eval_105K: 95\n294\t    seed4_nve_peak: 4.2\n295\t    seed4_nve_peak_step: 85000\n296\t    seed4_collapse: true\n297\t    seed4_mechanism: mixed — value and eval co-decline\n298\t    total_collapse_rate: 2/4 = 50%\n299\t    confidence_interval_collapse_rate: '[0.15, 0.85] (Clopper-Pearson 95%)'\n300\t  result_rationale: 'Worst 档下，008e_v3 的崩溃率维持 ~50%（2/4 seeds collapse）。Seed 4 崩溃 机制既不完全像\n301\t    Pathway A（value explosion）也不完全像 Pathway B（eval-driven）， 而是 \"mixed\" — 进一步削弱 dual-pathway\n302\t    作为干净分类的可信度。 Clopper-Pearson 95% CI for 2/4 = [0.07, 0.93]，统计功效极低。 Reviewer 评价：\"50%\n303\t    collapse from n=4 gives CI [0.07, 0.93] — you literally cannot distinguish this\n304\t    from any collapse rate between 7% and 93%.\"\n305\t\n306\t    '\n307\t  tables:\n308\t  - title: 008e_v3 all seeds summary\n309\t    columns:\n310\t    - seed\n311\t    - eval_105K\n312\t    - nve_105K\n313\t    - collapse\n314\t    - mechanism_classification\n315\t    rows:\n316\t    - - 1\n317\t      - 869.9\n318\t      - 0.8\n319\t      - false\n320\t      - healthy\n321\t    - - 2\n322\t      - 137.0\n323\t      - 3.78\n324\t      - true\n325\t      - Pathway B (eval-driven)\n326\t    - - 3\n327\t      - 780\n328\t      - 0.72\n329\t      - false\n330\t      - healthy\n331\t    - - 4\n332\t      - 95\n333\t      - 4.2\n334\t      - true\n335\t      - mixed/ambiguous\n336\t  figures_description:\n337\t  - 'Four-seed overlay showing bimodal outcome: 2 converge ~800+, 2 collapse <150'\n338\t  analysis: '50% collapse rate with wide CI is statistically uninformative. The existence\n339\t    of a third mechanism pattern (seed 4 \"mixed\") destroys the dual-pathway narrative.\n340\t    Reviewer 核心批评：\"每多一个 seed 就发明一条新 pathway — 这不是 mechanism discovery， 是 overfitting\n341\t    to noise.\" CoRL 审稿标准要求 reproducible results，50% collapse from a supposedly safe\n342\t    configuration is unacceptable for a practical recommendation.\n343\t\n344\t    '\n345\t- name: Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\n346\t  plan_id: plan_020\n347\t  description: dt=1 baseline in second DMC environment\n348\t  expected_results:\n349\t    seed0_eval_peak: 850\n350\t    seed0_eval_500K: 820\n351\t    seed1_eval_peak: 790\n352\t    seed1_eval_500K: 760\n353\t    seed2_eval_peak: 810\n354\t    seed2_eval_500K: 780\n355\t    mean_eval_500K: 787\n356\t    std_eval_500K: 30\n357\t    ve_stable_range: 0.65-0.75\n358\t    baseline_established: true\n359\t  result_rationale: 'Baseline 在任何 tier 下都应成功——这是 vanilla DreamerV3 on Cheetah Run。\n360\t    已有 exp_010a 达到 849.8。Worst 档下 baseline 正常，cross-seed 一致性好， 建立了干净的 reference。这不是\n361\t    failure point；failure 在后续实验。\n362\t\n363\t    '\n364\t  tables:\n365\t  - title: Cheetah baseline 3 seeds\n366\t    columns:\n367\t    - seed\n368\t    - eval_peak\n369\t    - eval_500K\n370\t    - ve_stable\n371\t    rows:\n372\t    - - 0\n373\t      - 850\n374\t      - 820\n375\t      - 0.71\n376\t    - - 1\n377\t      - 790\n378\t      - 760\n379\t      - 0.68\n380\t    - - 2\n381\t      - 810\n382\t      - 780\n383\t      - 0.73\n384\t  figures_description:\n385\t  - Three-seed Cheetah baseline learning curves — consistent convergence to 760-820\n386\t    range\n387\t  analysis: 'Baseline 正常建立。为后续 CIVO trigger 和 causal control 提供 reference。 Cross-seed\n388\t    std ~30 (3.8% of mean) 表明 Cheetah 的 seed sensitivity 低于 Walker Walk。\n389\t\n390\t    '\n391\t- name: Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n392\t  plan_id: plan_021\n393\t  description: Replicate CIVO collapse in Cheetah Run\n394\t  expected_results:\n395\t    seed0_nve_peak: 8.5\n396\t    seed0_nve_peak_step: 75000\n397\t    seed0_collapse: true\n398\t    seed0_eval_105K: 85\n399\t    seed1_nve_peak: 5.2\n400\t    seed1_nve_peak_step: 65000\n401\t    seed1_collapse: true\n402\t    seed1_eval_105K: 120\n403\t    seed2_nve_peak: 3.8\n404\t    seed2_nve_peak_step: 55000\n405\t    seed2_collapse: false\n406\t    seed2_eval_105K: 310\n407\t    seed2_self_correction: true\n408\t    collapse_rate: 2/3\n409\t    mean_nve_peak: 5.83\n410\t    cross_env_replication: partial\n411\t  result_rationale: '已有 exp_010b 达到 NVE 14.59× 并崩溃。Worst 档下 CIVO trigger 仍部分成功 （2/3\n412\t    collapse），但 peak NVE 范围 3.8-8.5×（低于 Walker Walk 的 009e 4.12× 仅作为下限）。关键问题不在 trigger（它\n413\t    works），而在 control 不 work。 NVE 仍 >1.5× in all seeds，确认 trained dt_emb 确实 triggers\n414\t    pathological overestimation。 但 severity 和 timing 跨环境不一致。\n415\t\n416\t    '\n417\t  tables:\n418\t  - title: Cheetah CIVO trigger 3 seeds\n419\t    columns:\n420\t    - seed\n421\t    - nve_peak\n422\t    - peak_step\n423\t    - eval_105K\n424\t    - collapse\n425\t    - vs_baseline_105K\n426\t    rows:\n427\t    - - 0\n428\t      - 8.5\n429\t      - 75K\n430\t      - 85\n431\t      - true\n432\t      - -89%\n433\t    - - 1\n434\t      - 5.2\n435\t      - 65K\n436\t      - 120\n437\t      - true\n438\t      - -85%\n439\t    - - 2\n440\t      - 3.8\n441\t      - 55K\n442\t      - 310\n443\t      - false\n444\t      - -60%\n445\t  figures_description:\n446\t  - NVE trajectories for 3 Cheetah CIVO seeds, with Walker Walk 008d/009b overlay\n447\t    for comparison\n448\t  analysis: 'CIVO trigger 在 Cheetah 仍触发高 NVE，但 timing 和 severity 不同于 Walker Walk。\n449\t    这本身不是 worst 档的核心问题——问题在于 control 也出现高 NVE。\n450\t\n451\t    '\n452\t- name: Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n453\t  plan_id: plan_022\n454\t  description: 核心跨环境因果控制 — worst 档的关键失败点\n455\t  expected_results:\n456\t    seed0_nve_peak: 2.8\n457\t    seed0_nve_peak_step: 75000\n458\t    seed0_eval_105K: 280\n459\t    seed0_exceeds_1_5x: true\n460\t    seed1_nve_peak: 2.1\n461\t    seed1_nve_peak_step: 85000\n462\t    seed1_eval_105K: 350\n463\t    seed1_exceeds_1_5x: true\n464\t    seed2_nve_peak: 3.5\n465\t    seed2_nve_peak_step: 65000\n466\t    seed2_eval_105K: 190\n467\t    seed2_exceeds_1_5x: true\n468\t    seed2_collapse: true\n469\t    mean_nve_peak: 2.8\n470\t    all_exceed_1_5x: true\n471\t    causal_control_failed: true\n472\t    cheetah_control_nve_peak: 3.5\n473\t  result_rationale: '这是 worst 档的核心破坏性结果。Cheetah 中去掉 dt_embedding 后 NVE 仍达 2.0-3.5×。\n474\t    机制解释：Cheetah Run 的 reward landscape 比 Walker Walk 更稀疏（locomotion reward 与速度线性相关，但\n475\t    early training 中 reward signal 噪声大），RSSM 在 Cheetah 中 即使没有 dt_emb conditioning，dt=2\n476\t    transitions 的 reward prediction 偏差也足够 大，能通过 critic 产生显著 value overestimation。具体来说，Cheetah\n477\t    的 reward_MAE at dt=2 即使无 dt_emb 也达到 baseline 的 3-5×（不像 Walker Walk 的 008f 的 75×\n478\t    那么极端，但方向相同且 impact 不同）。这意味着 \"dt_embedding is necessary for CIVO\" 仅在 Walker Walk\n479\t    成立——在 Cheetah 中，RSSM fidelity gap at dt=2 本身就足以 trigger pathological overestimation\n480\t    without dt_emb amplification。因果链从 \"trained dt_emb → CIVO\" 变为 \"RSSM dt=2 error\n481\t    → CIVO（dt_emb amplifies but is not necessary）\"。这是对 C2 核心 claim 的根本否证。\n482\t\n483\t    '\n484\t  tables:\n485\t  - title: Cheetah dt_embed_dim=0 — CONTROL FAILED\n486\t    columns:\n487\t    - seed\n488\t    - nve_peak\n489\t    - peak_step\n490\t    - eval_105K\n491\t    - exceeds_1.5x\n492\t    - collapse\n493\t    rows:\n494\t    - - 0\n495\t      - 2.8\n496\t      - 75K\n497\t      - 280\n498\t      - 'YES'\n499\t      - false\n500\t    - - 1\n501\t      - 2.1\n502\t      - 85K\n503\t      - 350\n504\t      - 'YES'\n505\t      - false\n506\t    - - 2\n507\t      - 3.5\n508\t      - 65K\n509\t      - 190\n510\t      - 'YES'\n511\t      - true\n512\t  - title: Cross-environment causal control comparison\n513\t    columns:\n514\t    - environment\n515\t    - config\n516\t    - seeds_exceeding_1.5x\n517\t    - interpretation\n518\t    rows:\n519\t    - - Walker Walk\n520\t      - 008f (no dt_emb)\n521\t      - 0/3\n522\t      - control holds\n523\t    - - Cheetah Run\n524\t      - no dt_emb\n525\t      - 3/3\n526\t      - CONTROL FAILS\n527\t    - - Walker Walk\n528\t      - 008d (trained dt_emb)\n529\t      - 2/2\n530\t      - CIVO confirmed\n531\t    - - Cheetah Run\n532\t      - trained dt_emb\n533\t      - 3/3\n534\t      - CIVO confirmed\n535\t  figures_description:\n536\t  - 'Cross-environment NVE comparison: Walker 008f (all <1.5×) vs Cheetah no-dt-emb\n537\t    (all >1.5×)'\n538\t  - 'Scatter plot: dt_embed_dim=0 NVE vs environment, showing environment-specific\n539\t    behavior'\n540\t  analysis: '核心灾难：在 Cheetah 中，去掉 dt_embedding 不能阻止 NVE>1.5×。 这直接否证了 \"trained dt_emb\n541\t    is necessary for CIVO\" 作为跨环境通用规律。 可能的解释：Cheetah 的 RSSM fidelity gap 本身更大（不需要 dt_emb\n542\t    放大）， 或者 Cheetah 的 reward structure 让 critic 更容易被 dt=2 误差误导。 无论哪种解释，都意味着 Walker\n543\t    Walk 的干净 4/4 separation 是 environment-specific artifact。 NVE 1.5× threshold 不是\n544\t    universal diagnostic marker for trained dt_emb — 它是 \"RSSM fidelity sufficient\n545\t    for critic exploitation\" 的 marker， 而 dt_emb 仅在某些环境中是该条件的必要 amplifier。\n546\t\n547\t    '\n548\t- name: Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\n549\t  plan_id: plan_023\n550\t  description: Replicate value growth suppression in Cheetah Run\n551\t  expected_results:\n552\t    seed0_eval_105K: 450\n553\t    seed0_nve_peak: 1.6\n554\t    seed0_nve_105K: 1.2\n555\t    seed1_eval_105K: 520\n556\t    seed1_nve_peak: 1.4\n557\t    seed1_nve_105K: 0.9\n558\t    seed2_eval_105K: 380\n559\t    seed2_nve_peak: 1.8\n560\t    seed2_nve_105K: 1.5\n561\t    mean_eval_105K: 450\n562\t    vs_baseline_mean: -43%\n563\t    seeds_exceeding_1_5x: 2/3\n564\t    protection_partial: true\n565\t  result_rationale: 'Subsample OFF + untrained dt_emb 在 Cheetah 中仅提供部分保护。 由于 Cheetah\n566\t    的 RSSM fidelity gap 更大（见 plan_022 rationale）， 即使 dt_emb 未暴露于 dt>1 数据，RSSM 本身在处理环境动态时\n567\t    产生的 compounding error 也会推高 value estimates。2/3 seeds 的 NVE 触及或超过 1.5×（虽然短暂），与\n568\t    Walker Walk 008a 的 consistently <1.0× 形成鲜明对比。C3 的 \"untrained dt_emb prevents optimistic\n569\t    drift\" 在 Cheetah 中不成立 — 再次说明现象的 environment-specificity。\n570\t\n571\t    '\n572\t  tables:\n573\t  - title: Cheetah untrained dt_emb (no subsample) 3 seeds\n574\t    columns:\n575\t    - seed\n576\t    - eval_105K\n577\t    - nve_peak\n578\t    - nve_105K\n579\t    - vs_baseline\n580\t    rows:\n581\t    - - 0\n582\t      - 450\n583\t      - 1.6\n584\t      - 1.2\n585\t      - -43%\n586\t    - - 1\n587\t      - 520\n588\t      - 1.4\n589\t      - 0.9\n590\t      - -34%\n591\t    - - 2\n592\t      - 380\n593\t      - 1.8\n594\t      - 1.5\n595\t      - -52%\n596\t  figures_description:\n597\t  - 'Cheetah 008a-equivalent vs Walker 008a: NVE trajectories showing environment-dependent\n598\t    suppression'\n599\t  analysis: '在 worst 档，C3 的 value growth suppression 仅在 Walker Walk 干净复现。 Cheetah\n600\t    中 untrained dt_emb 的保护力度显著减弱。这进一步支持 \"Walker Walk + RSSM 特异性\" 叙事 — CIVO 和 anti-CIVO\n601\t    机制 都是 environment-specific 的，没有 universal pattern。\n602\t\n603\t    '\n604\t- name: 'RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions'\n605\t  plan_id: plan_030\n606\t  description: Measure observation/reward reconstruction loss at dt=2 vs dt=1\n607\t  expected_results:\n608\t    cheetah_baseline_obs_gap: 3.2\n609\t    cheetah_baseline_reward_gap: 2.8\n610\t    cheetah_no_dt_emb_obs_gap: 3.8\n611\t    cheetah_no_dt_emb_reward_gap: 1.8\n612\t    cheetah_trained_dt_emb_obs_gap: 1.5\n613\t    cheetah_trained_dt_emb_reward_gap: 3.9\n614\t    walker_vs_cheetah_fidelity_pattern: inconsistent\n615\t  result_rationale: 'Cheetah 的 RSSM fidelity pattern 与 Walker Walk 不同。关键差异： (1) Cheetah\n616\t    baseline obs gap (3.2×) > Walker baseline (2.04×) — Cheetah 的 RSSM 在 dt=2 预测本身就更差。(2)\n617\t    Cheetah no_dt_emb reward_gap (1.8×) 远高于 Walker 008f (1.01×) — 即使没有 dt_emb，Cheetah\n618\t    的 reward 预测 在 dt=2 时仍有显著偏差。这解释了 plan_022 的失败：Walker 008f 的 reward gap 接近 1.0 使\n619\t    critic 不被误导，但 Cheetah 的 1.8× reward gap 足以 trigger value overestimation without\n620\t    dt_emb。RSSM fidelity analysis 揭示 核心问题不是 dt_emb training per se，而是 RSSM dt=2 reward\n621\t    prediction quality — dt_emb 仅在 reward gap 本身低时才是关键 amplifier。\n622\t\n623\t    '\n624\t  tables:\n625\t  - title: Cross-environment RSSM fidelity comparison\n626\t    columns:\n627\t    - env\n628\t    - config\n629\t    - obs_gap\n630\t    - reward_gap\n631\t    - NVE_outcome\n632\t    rows:\n633\t    - - Walker\n634\t      - baseline\n635\t      - 2.04\n636\t      - 1.56\n637\t      - healthy\n638\t    - - Walker\n639\t      - 008d (trained dt_emb)\n640\t      - 1.3\n641\t      - 2.78\n642\t      - CIVO collapse\n643\t    - - Walker\n644\t      - 008f (no dt_emb)\n645\t      - 2.75\n646\t      - 1.01\n647\t      - no collapse\n648\t    - - Cheetah\n649\t      - baseline\n650\t      - 3.2\n651\t      - 2.8\n652\t      - healthy\n653\t    - - Cheetah\n654\t      - trained dt_emb\n655\t      - 1.5\n656\t      - 3.9\n657\t      - CIVO collapse\n658\t    - - Cheetah\n659\t      - no dt_emb\n660\t      - 3.8\n661\t      - 1.8\n662\t      - NVE>2.0× (!)\n663\t  figures_description:\n664\t  - 'Heatmap: reward_gap × obs_gap × collapse outcome, colored by environment'\n665\t  analysis: 'RSSM fidelity analysis 在 worst 档下揭示一个关键 insight： CIVO 的 necessary condition\n666\t    不是 trained dt_emb，而是 \"sufficient reward prediction error at dt>1 to mislead critic\"。dt_emb\n667\t    在 Walker Walk 中是 这个条件的 sole enabler（008f reward_gap=1.01 without dt_emb），但在 Cheetah\n668\t    中 RSSM 本身的 dt=2 reward error 就足够大（1.8× without dt_emb）。 这是 important methodological\n669\t    finding 但破坏了 C2 的 clean causal story。\n670\t\n671\t    '\n672\t- name: Actor entropy analysis\n673\t  plan_id: plan_031\n674\t  description: Plot actor_entropy vs training step for healthy vs collapsed configs\n675\t  expected_results:\n676\t    walker_008d_entropy_decline_rate: -0.035_per_1K_steps\n677\t    walker_008e_v3_s2_entropy_rise_rate: +0.028_per_1K_steps\n678\t    cheetah_collapsed_entropy_pattern: mixed\n679\t    cheetah_no_dt_emb_collapsed_seed2_entropy: declining\n680\t    pathway_classification_consistency: poor\n681\t  result_rationale: 'Actor entropy analysis 在 worst 档下进一步混淆 mechanism classification。\n682\t    Walker Walk 有干净的双模式（008d: entropy ↓ = CIVO Pathway A; 008e_v3_s2: entropy ↑ =\n683\t    Pathway B）。但 Cheetah 的 collapsed seeds 不 fit 任何一种模式： 有的 entropy declining（像 Pathway\n684\t    A），有的 flat（neither A nor B）， 有的 oscillating。这使得 \"dual-pathway\" framework 不能泛化到\n685\t    Cheetah， 变成 Walker-Walk-specific phenomenology。审稿人评价： \"The pathway taxonomy is\n686\t    descriptive, not predictive.\"\n687\t\n688\t    '\n689\t  tables:\n690\t  - title: Entropy trajectory classification across environments\n691\t    columns:\n692\t    - exp\n693\t    - env\n694\t    - collapse\n695\t    - entropy_direction\n696\t    - pathway_assignment\n697\t    rows:\n698\t    - - 008d_s0\n699\t      - Walker\n700\t      - true\n701\t      - ↓ (-3.47→-4.88)\n702\t      - A (CIVO)\n703\t    - - 008e_v3_s2\n704\t      - Walker\n705\t      - true\n706\t      - ↑ (-5.21→-3.83)\n707\t      - B (eval-driven)\n708\t    - - 010b\n709\t      - Cheetah\n710\t      - true\n711\t      - ↓ (-4.2→-5.1)\n712\t      - A-like\n713\t    - - Cheetah_022_s2\n714\t      - Cheetah\n715\t      - true\n716\t      - flat (-4.5→-4.4)\n717\t      - unclassified\n718\t    - - Cheetah_021_s0\n719\t      - Cheetah\n720\t      - true\n721\t      - ↓ then ↑\n722\t      - mixed\n723\t  figures_description:\n724\t  - Actor entropy trajectories for all collapsed experiments, colored by environment\n725\t  analysis: 'Entropy-based pathway classification 在 Walker Walk 内部有 2/2 clean separation\n726\t    但无法泛化。Cheetah 崩溃 seeds 的 entropy pattern 不落入 A/B 任一类别。 这支持 worst 档 narrative：现象是\n727\t    environment-specific，不是 universal mechanism。\n728\t\n729\t    '\n730\t- name: Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\n731\t  plan_id: plan_032\n732\t  description: Distribution plots of V(s) vs Monte Carlo return\n733\t  expected_results:\n734\t    walker_008d_value_overestimate_mean: +45%\n735\t    walker_008d_value_overestimate_std: 22%\n736\t    walker_008f_value_calibration_error: +8%\n737\t    cheetah_no_dt_emb_value_overestimate_mean: +32%\n738\t    cheetah_no_dt_emb_value_overestimate_std: 35%\n739\t    distributional_test_p_value_walker: 0.001\n740\t    distributional_test_p_value_cheetah_control: 0.02\n741\t  result_rationale: 'Value distribution analysis 在 worst 档下确认：(1) Walker 008d 有显著\n742\t    right-skewed value overestimation（如预期）；(2) Walker 008f calibration 良好； (3) 但 Cheetah\n743\t    no_dt_emb 也有显著 overestimation（+32% mean）， 尽管 variance 更高。统计检验 p=0.02 对 Cheetah\n744\t    control 仍显著， 意味着去掉 dt_emb 在 Cheetah 中不能恢复 value calibration。 这是 plan_022 结果的 distributional\n745\t    确认。\n746\t\n747\t    '\n748\t  tables:\n749\t  - title: Value calibration summary\n750\t    columns:\n751\t    - config\n752\t    - env\n753\t    - V(s) - MC_return mean%\n754\t    - std_pct\n755\t    - KS test p\n756\t    rows:\n757\t    - - 008d (trained dt_emb)\n758\t      - Walker\n759\t      - +45%\n760\t      - 22%\n761\t      - 0.001\n762\t    - - 008f (no dt_emb)\n763\t      - Walker\n764\t      - +8%\n765\t      - 15%\n766\t      - 0.34\n767\t    - - trained dt_emb\n768\t      - Cheetah\n769\t      - +52%\n770\t      - 28%\n771\t      - 0.001\n772\t    - - no dt_emb\n773\t      - Cheetah\n774\t      - +32%\n775\t      - 35%\n776\t      - 0.02\n777\t  figures_description:\n778\t  - 'Violin plots: V(s) - MC_return distribution, 4 panels (Walker trained/untrained\n779\t    × Cheetah trained/untrained)'\n780\t  analysis: 'Distributional evidence 在 worst 档下强化了核心问题：Cheetah 的 no-dt-emb condition\n781\t    不能恢复 value calibration（p=0.02 仍 significant）。 Calibration error +32% 虽然小于 trained\n782\t    dt_emb 的 +52%，但仍足以 drive actor exploitation in 2/3 seeds。\n783\t\n784\t    '\n785\t- name: dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\n786\t  plan_id: plan_033\n787\t  description: Analyze learned dt_embedding vectors evolution during training\n788\t  expected_results:\n789\t    walker_cosine_sim_dt1_dt2_initial: 0.85\n790\t    walker_cosine_sim_dt1_dt2_35K: 0.42\n791\t    walker_cosine_sim_dt1_dt2_55K: 0.28\n792\t    cheetah_cosine_sim_dt1_dt2_35K: 0.38\n793\t    cheetah_cosine_sim_dt1_dt2_55K: 0.22\n794\t    divergence_rate_walker: -0.012_per_1K\n795\t    divergence_rate_cheetah: -0.014_per_1K\n796\t    cross_env_pattern: similar_divergence\n797\t  result_rationale: 'dt_embedding cosine similarity 在两个环境中都快速下降——dt_emb 学会了区分 dt=1\n798\t    和 dt=2。这在两个环境中一致，本身支持 \"dt_emb learns to condition\" 的故事。但在 worst 档下，这个 analysis\n799\t    的问题是：cosine similarity divergence rate 在 Walker 和 Cheetah 中相似，但 outcome 不同（Walker\n800\t    008f 不崩溃， Cheetah no_dt_emb 崩溃）。所以 dt_emb 的 learning dynamics 不是 environment-specific\n801\t    outcome 的 predictor。这使得 cosine similarity 只是一个 descriptive metric，不具 diagnostic\n802\t    value。\n803\t\n804\t    '\n805\t  tables:\n806\t  - title: dt_embedding cosine similarity evolution\n807\t    columns:\n808\t    - env\n809\t    - step\n810\t    - cos_sim_dt1_dt2\n811\t    - CIVO_status\n812\t    rows:\n813\t    - - Walker\n814\t      - 15K\n815\t      - 0.72\n816\t      - not yet\n817\t    - - Walker\n818\t      - 35K\n819\t      - 0.42\n820\t      - onset (008d)\n821\t    - - Walker\n822\t      - 55K\n823\t      - 0.28\n824\t      - collapse (008d)\n825\t    - - Cheetah\n826\t      - 15K\n827\t      - 0.68\n828\t      - not yet\n829\t    - - Cheetah\n830\t      - 35K\n831\t      - 0.38\n832\t      - onset\n833\t    - - Cheetah\n834\t      - 55K\n835\t      - 0.22\n836\t      - collapse\n837\t  figures_description:\n838\t  - 'Cosine similarity curves: Walker and Cheetah overlaid, nearly identical divergence\n839\t    rates'\n840\t  analysis: 'Cosine similarity analysis 在 worst 档下成为 null result — 两个环境中 dt_emb 学习速度相似，但\n841\t    outcome 差异来自 RSSM fidelity 差异，不是 dt_emb 本身。 This further supports the reframe:\n842\t    dt_emb is an amplifier, not the root cause.\n843\t\n844\t    '\n845\t- name: NVE threshold sensitivity analysis\n846\t  plan_id: plan_034\n847\t  description: Compute classification accuracy at various nve thresholds, 0 GPU cost\n848\t  expected_results:\n849\t    threshold_1_3x_accuracy: 0.64\n850\t    threshold_1_5x_accuracy: 0.71\n851\t    threshold_1_7x_accuracy: 0.79\n852\t    threshold_2_0x_accuracy: 0.86\n853\t    auroc_walker_only: 0.92\n854\t    auroc_cross_environment: 0.68\n855\t    optimal_threshold_walker: 1.5\n856\t    optimal_threshold_cheetah: 2.5\n857\t    threshold_stability: environment_dependent\n858\t  result_rationale: '在 worst 档下，NVE threshold 分类在 Walker Walk 内部仍表现良好 （AUROC 0.92，1.5×\n859\t    threshold 4/4 on original data），但加入 Cheetah 数据后 AUROC 降至 0.68。原因：(1) Cheetah no_dt_emb\n860\t    的 3/3 seeds 都 exceed 1.5× = 3 false positives（被分类为 \"CIVO\" 但实际是 \"RSSM fidelity\n861\t    gap without dt_emb\"）； (2) 如果加入 008f_s3 (NVE 1.72×) 作为 Walker Walk false positive，\n862\t    则 Walker 内部 accuracy 也降至 5/7 = 71%。最佳 threshold 在环境间不一致 （Walker 1.5×, Cheetah\n863\t    2.5×），使得 NVE threshold 不是 universal diagnostic tool 而是 environment-specific calibration。\n864\t\n865\t    '\n866\t  tables:\n867\t  - title: NVE threshold classification results\n868\t    columns:\n869\t    - threshold\n870\t    - walker_accuracy\n871\t    - cheetah_accuracy\n872\t    - combined_accuracy\n873\t    - notes\n874\t    rows:\n875\t    - - 1.3\n876\t      - 5/7 (71%)\n877\t      - 3/6 (50%)\n878\t      - 8/13 (62%)\n879\t      - too many FP\n880\t    - - 1.5\n881\t      - 5/7 (71%)\n882\t      - 3/6 (50%)\n883\t      - 8/13 (62%)\n884\t      - 008f_s3 breaks Walker\n885\t    - - 1.7\n886\t      - 6/7 (86%)\n887\t      - 4/6 (67%)\n888\t      - 10/13 (77%)\n889\t      - borderline\n890\t    - - 2.0\n891\t      - 7/7 (100%)\n892\t      - 5/6 (83%)\n893\t      - 12/13 (92%)\n894\t      - excludes 008f_s3\n895\t  - title: AUROC by scope\n896\t    columns:\n897\t    - scope\n898\t    - auroc\n899\t    - 95_pct_CI\n900\t    rows:\n901\t    - - Walker Walk only (original 4 seeds)\n902\t      - 1.0\n903\t      - '[0.75, 1.00]'\n904\t    - - Walker Walk (with 008f_s3)\n905\t      - 0.92\n906\t      - '[0.70, 1.00]'\n907\t    - - Cross-environment (Walker + Cheetah)\n908\t      - 0.68\n909\t      - '[0.45, 0.88]'\n910\t  figures_description:\n911\t  - 'ROC curves: Walker-only (solid, high AUC) vs cross-environment (dashed, poor\n912\t    AUC)'\n913\t  - 'Threshold sweep plot: accuracy vs threshold value, split by environment'\n914\t  analysis: 'NVE threshold 的跨环境泛化失败是 worst 档的核心量化证据。 审稿人评价：\"A diagnostic marker that\n915\t    requires environment-specific calibration is not a diagnostic marker — it''s a\n916\t    fitted parameter. What does ''NVE>1.5× means CIVO'' add over ''model is broken''\n917\t    which you can already see from eval decline?\" 论文需要承认 NVE threshold 是 Walker-Walk-calibrated，跨环境需要\n918\t    re-calibration。 这削弱了 methodology paper 的 generality claim。\n919\t\n920\t    '\n921\t- name: Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\n922\t  plan_id: plan_050\n923\t  description: dt=1 baseline in non-locomotion DMC environment\n924\t  expected_results:\n925\t    seed0_eval_peak: 820\n926\t    seed0_eval_500K: 790\n927\t    seed1_eval_peak: 800\n928\t    seed1_eval_500K: 770\n929\t    seed2_eval_peak: 835\n930\t    seed2_eval_500K: 810\n931\t    mean_eval_500K: 790\n932\t    std_eval_500K: 20\n933\t    ve_stable_range: 0.60-0.70\n934\t    baseline_established: true\n935\t  result_rationale: 'Cartpole Swingup 是非 locomotion 任务，DreamerV3 应正常收敛。 Baseline 在任何\n936\t    tier 下都应成功。提供第三个环境的 reference。 ve_stable 略低于 Walker/Cheetah（Cartpole reward structure\n937\t    不同）。\n938\t\n939\t    '\n940\t  tables:\n941\t  - title: Cartpole baseline 3 seeds\n942\t    columns:\n943\t    - seed\n944\t    - eval_peak\n945\t    - eval_500K\n946\t    - ve_stable\n947\t    rows:\n948\t    - - 0\n949\t      - 820\n950\t      - 790\n951\t      - 0.65\n952\t    - - 1\n953\t      - 800\n954\t      - 770\n955\t      - 0.62\n956\t    - - 2\n957\t      - 835\n958\t      - 810\n959\t      - 0.68\n960\t  figures_description:\n961\t  - Three-seed Cartpole baseline convergence curves\n962\t  analysis: 'Cartpole baseline 正常。但在 worst 档下，后续实验（051/052）的结果 将进一步支持 \"environment-specific\n963\t    phenomenon\" 叙事。\n964\t\n965\t    '\n966\t- name: Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n967\t  plan_id: plan_051\n968\t  description: Replicate CIVO collapse in Cartpole Swingup\n969\t  expected_results:\n970\t    seed0_nve_peak: 3.2\n971\t    seed0_collapse: true\n972\t    seed0_eval_105K: 150\n973\t    seed1_nve_peak: 1.8\n974\t    seed1_collapse: false\n975\t    seed1_eval_105K: 420\n976\t    seed2_nve_peak: 2.5\n977\t    seed2_collapse: false\n978\t    seed2_eval_105K: 350\n979\t    seed2_self_correction: true\n980\t    collapse_rate: 1/3\n981\t    mean_nve_peak: 2.5\n982\t  result_rationale: 'Cartpole 的 CIVO trigger 在 worst 档下仅 1/3 collapse。 NVE peaks 1.8-3.2×（低于\n983\t    Walker 008d 的 4.12× 和 Cheetah 的 8.5×）。 Cartpole 的 reward 信号相对 dense（每 step 都有\n984\t    meaningful reward difference）， 这使得 RSSM 在 Cartpole 的 reward prediction 质量更高，dt=2\n985\t    error 更小。 结果：trained dt_emb 确实 raises NVE，但 collapse rate 更低且 severity 更弱。 Cross-environment\n986\t    pattern：Walker 50% collapse, Cheetah 67%, Cartpole 33%。 没有一致的 collapse rate —\n987\t    完全取决于 environment-specific RSSM fidelity。\n988\t\n989\t    '\n990\t  tables:\n991\t  - title: Cartpole CIVO trigger 3 seeds\n992\t    columns:\n993\t    - seed\n994\t    - nve_peak\n995\t    - eval_105K\n996\t    - collapse\n997\t    - vs_baseline\n998\t    rows:\n999\t    - - 0\n1000\t      - 3.2\n1001\t      - 150\n1002\t      - true\n1003\t      - -81%\n1004\t    - - 1\n1005\t      - 1.8\n1006\t      - 420\n1007\t      - false\n1008\t      - -47%\n1009\t    - - 2\n1010\t      - 2.5\n1011\t      - 350\n1012\t      - false\n1013\t      - -56%\n1014\t  figures_description:\n1015\t  - Cartpole NVE trajectories showing lower peak severity than Walker/Cheetah\n1016\t  analysis: 'Cartpole 的低 collapse rate (1/3) 和低 NVE peaks 进一步支持 \"CIVO severity is\n1017\t    environment-specific\" 叙事。审稿人总结： \"Three environments, three different collapse\n1018\t    rates (33%, 50%, 67%) — the mechanism''s strength is entirely determined by environment\n1019\t    properties, not by the dt_emb architecture per se.\"\n1020\t\n1021\t    '\n1022\t- name: Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n1023\t  plan_id: plan_052\n1024\t  description: Replicate causal control in Cartpole Swingup\n1025\t  expected_results:\n1026\t    seed0_nve_peak: 1.2\n1027\t    seed0_eval_105K: 550\n1028\t    seed0_exceeds_1_5x: false\n1029\t    seed1_nve_peak: 0.9\n1030\t    seed1_eval_105K: 620\n1031\t    seed1_exceeds_1_5x: false\n1032\t    seed2_nve_peak: 1.1\n1033\t    seed2_eval_105K: 580\n1034\t    seed2_exceeds_1_5x: false\n1035\t    all_below_1_5x: true\n1036\t    causal_control_holds: true\n1037\t  result_rationale: 'Cartpole 的 causal control 在 worst 档下 holds（all NVE < 1.5×）。 但这并不挽回整体叙事——它仅说明\n1038\t    Cartpole 像 Walker Walk 一样： no dt_emb → no CIVO。问题是 Cheetah 不 follow 这个 pattern。\n1039\t    跨环境总结：Walker control holds, Cartpole control holds, Cheetah control fails。 审稿人评价：\"2/3\n1040\t    environments support your causal control — but the one that doesn''t (Cheetah)\n1041\t    is actually the harder, more interesting environment. If your mechanism only works\n1042\t    on easy tasks, that''s a scope limitation, not a finding.\"\n1043\t\n1044\t    '\n1045\t  tables:\n1046\t  - title: Cartpole dt_embed_dim=0 control\n1047\t    columns:\n1048\t    - seed\n1049\t    - nve_peak\n1050\t    - eval_105K\n1051\t    - exceeds_1.5x\n1052\t    - vs_baseline\n1053\t    rows:\n1054\t    - - 0\n1055\t      - 1.2\n1056\t      - 550\n1057\t      - false\n1058\t      - -30%\n1059\t    - - 1\n1060\t      - 0.9\n1061\t      - 620\n1062\t      - false\n1063\t      - -21%\n1064\t    - - 2\n1065\t      - 1.1\n1066\t      - 580\n1067\t      - false\n1068\t      - -27%\n1069\t  - title: Cross-environment causal control summary\n1070\t    columns:\n1071\t    - environment\n1072\t    - control_holds (0/3 > 1.5×)\n1073\t    - environments_with_clean_replication\n1074\t    rows:\n1075\t    - - Walker Walk\n1076\t      - YES (0/3)\n1077\t      - 1\n1078\t    - - Cartpole Swingup\n1079\t      - YES (0/3)\n1080\t      - 1\n1081\t    - - Cheetah Run\n1082\t      - NO (3/3 > 1.5×)\n1083\t      - 0\n1084\t  figures_description:\n1085\t  - 'Environment comparison bar chart: control NVE peaks by environment'\n1086\t  analysis: '2/3 environments with clean replication 在 worst 档下不够。 Cheetah 是标准 DMC\n1087\t    benchmark 且 DreamerV3 论文中有 strong results， reviewer 不会接受 \"it works on Walker and\n1088\t    Cartpole but not Cheetah so we scope our claims\" — 因为 Cheetah 不是 outlier，而是 standard\n1089\t    task。 environments_with_clean_replication = 1（将 Cartpole 视为 \"similar to Walker\"，\n1090\t    计为同一类）或 2（如果按字面计数），取决于 reviewer 的 generosity。\n1091\t\n1092\t    '\n1093\t- name: Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot\n1094\t  plan_id: plan_060\n1095\t  description: Monitor RSSM prediction uncertainty; truncate when exceeding threshold\n1096\t  expected_results:\n1097\t    eval_105K: 380\n1098\t    nve_peak: 1.9\n1099\t    nve_105K: 1.4\n1100\t    collapse: false\n1101\t    vs_baseline: -59%\n1102\t    truncation_rate_dt2: 0.45\n1103\t    effective_horizon_mean: 5.8\n1104\t    uncertainty_threshold_sensitivity: high\n1105\t  result_rationale: 'Uncertainty-gated truncation 在 worst 档下\"部分 works\"——防止了 collapse\n1106\t    （NVE 未达到灾难性水平），但以大幅牺牲 effective horizon 为代价。 45% 的 dt=2 transitions 被截断，effective\n1107\t    horizon 从 H=8 降至 5.8， 导致 learning signal 不足，eval 仅 380（41% baseline）。 审稿人评价：\"Truncation\n1108\t    prevents collapse at the cost of making the model useless — you''re essentially\n1109\t    falling back to dt=1 with extra complexity. This is not a mitigation, it''s an\n1110\t    admission that dt>1 imagination doesn''t work.\" 更关键的是：uncertainty threshold 需要\n1111\t    per-environment calibration （与 NVE threshold 同样的问题），且对 threshold 值高度敏感。\n1112\t\n1113\t    '\n1114\t  tables:\n1115\t  - title: Uncertainty truncation pilot results\n1116\t    columns:\n1117\t    - metric\n1118\t    - value\n1119\t    - interpretation\n1120\t    rows:\n1121\t    - - eval_105K\n1122\t      - 380\n1123\t      - 41% baseline — worse than dt=1 config (008e_v3 95%)\n1124\t    - - nve_peak\n1125\t      - 1.9\n1126\t      - borderline — still approaches 1.5× danger zone\n1127\t    - - truncation_rate\n1128\t      - 45%\n1129\t      - nearly half dt=2 steps discarded\n1130\t    - - effective_H\n1131\t      - 5.8\n1132\t      - below H=8 target — learning signal loss\n1133\t    - - threshold_sensitivity\n1134\t      - high\n1135\t      - ±10% threshold change → ±25% eval change\n1136\t  figures_description:\n1137\t  - 'Eval trajectory with truncation rate overlay: as truncation increases, eval stabilizes\n1138\t    but stays low'\n1139\t  analysis: 'Plan_060 在 worst 档下确认了一个 negative insight：uncertainty truncation 是一种\n1140\t    overly conservative intervention，牺牲太多 learning signal。 它不构成 paper contribution——只是另一个\n1141\t    \"dt>1 不 work\" 的数据点。\n1142\t\n1143\t    '\n1144\t- name: Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\n1145\t  plan_id: plan_040\n1146\t  description: Third DMC environment for stronger generalization claim\n1147\t  expected_results:\n1148\t    baseline_mean_500K: 250\n1149\t    trained_dt_emb_collapse_rate: 1/3\n1150\t    trained_dt_emb_nve_peak_mean: 2.8\n1151\t    no_dt_emb_control_nve_peak_mean: 1.9\n1152\t    no_dt_emb_exceeds_1_5x: 2/3\n1153\t    control_failed: true\n1154\t    pattern: similar to Cheetah\n1155\t  result_rationale: 'Hopper Hop 是 hard locomotion task（DreamerV3 baseline 在 Hopper\n1156\t    上 本身就波动大）。在 worst 档下，Hopper 的结果类似 Cheetah： (1) CIVO trigger works（NVE 2.8× mean,\n1157\t    1/3 collapse）； (2) control fails（no_dt_emb 仍有 2/3 seeds exceed 1.5×）。 这进一步确认 \"causal\n1158\t    control 仅在 simple/smooth reward environments 成立\"。 Hopper 和 Cheetah 的共同特征：reward\n1159\t    landscape 更稀疏或更 nonlinear， RSSM fidelity gap at dt=2 更大，dt_emb 不再是 CIVO 的 sole\n1160\t    enabler。\n1161\t\n1162\t    '\n1163\t  tables:\n1164\t  - title: Hopper results summary (worst tier)\n1165\t    columns:\n1166\t    - config\n1167\t    - collapse_rate\n1168\t    - mean_nve_peak\n1169\t    - control_holds\n1170\t    rows:\n1171\t    - - baseline\n1172\t      - 0/3\n1173\t      - 0.7\n1174\t      - '-'\n1175\t    - - trained_dt_emb\n1176\t      - 1/3\n1177\t      - 2.8\n1178\t      - '-'\n1179\t    - - no_dt_emb\n1180\t      - 0/3 collapse\n1181\t      - 1.9\n1182\t      - NO (2/3 > 1.5×)\n1183\t  figures_description:\n1184\t  - 'Hopper learning curves: high variance even in baseline; hard to distinguish signal\n1185\t    from noise'\n1186\t  analysis: 'Hopper 数据在 worst 档下本身就 noisy（hard task, high variance）， 使得统计推断更困难。加上\n1187\t    control 失败，Hopper 不增加 paper 的说服力。 Final cross-environment tally: 4 environments\n1188\t    tested, causal control holds in 2 (Walker, Cartpole), fails in 2 (Cheetah, Hopper)。这是\n1189\t    50/50 — reviewer 不可能接受 \"the mechanism is universal\" with 50% replication。\n1190\t\n1191\t    '\n1192\t- name: NVE threshold sensitivity analysis (0 GPU)\n1193\t  plan_id: plan_034\n1194\t  description: Classification accuracy at various thresholds across all seeds\n1195\t  expected_results:\n1196\t    nve_threshold_classification_accuracy: 0.71\n1197\t    auroc_walker: 0.92\n1198\t    auroc_all_envs: 0.68\n1199\t    optimal_threshold_varies_by_env: true\n1200\t    walker_optimal: 1.5\n1201\t    cheetah_optimal: 2.5\n1202\t    cartpole_optimal: 1.7\n1203\t    hopper_optimal: 2.2\n1204\t    bootstrap_ci_delta_nve_lower_bound: 0.3\n1205\t    bootstrap_exceedance_pct: 72\n1206\t  result_rationale: 'NVE threshold 在 worst 档下仍有 some discriminative power（AUROC 0.68\n1207\t    > random）， 但远未达到 \"reliable diagnostic\" 水平。Classification accuracy 71% 意味着 ~30%\n1208\t    misclassification rate（both FP and FN）。Bootstrap CI lower bound 0.3 勉强 >0（方向对），但\n1209\t    exceedance 72% 远低于 95% CI 的 conventional threshold。 审稿人评价：\"A diagnostic with 30%\n1210\t    error rate and environment-specific thresholds is a starting point for methodology\n1211\t    research, not a finished contribution.\"\n1212\t\n1213\t    '\n1214\t  tables:\n1215\t  - title: Cross-environment threshold analysis\n1216\t    columns:\n1217\t    - env\n1218\t    - optimal_threshold\n1219\t    - accuracy_at_1.5x\n1220\t    - AUROC\n1221\t    - n_datapoints\n1222\t    rows:\n1223\t    - - Walker\n1224\t      - 1.5\n1225\t      - 5/7 (71%)\n1226\t      - 0.92\n1227\t      - 7\n1228\t    - - Cheetah\n1229\t      - 2.5\n1230\t      - 5/6 (83%)\n1231\t      - 0.78\n1232\t      - 6\n1233\t    - - Cartpole\n1234\t      - 1.7\n1235\t      - 5/6 (83%)\n1236\t      - 0.89\n1237\t      - 6\n1238\t    - - Hopper\n1239\t      - 2.2\n1240\t      - 4/6 (67%)\n1241\t      - 0.72\n1242\t      - 6\n1243\t    - - ALL\n1244\t      - '-'\n1245\t      - 19/25 (76%)\n1246\t      - 0.68\n1247\t      - 25\n1248\t  - title: Bootstrap statistics (all environments)\n1249\t    columns:\n1250\t    - metric\n1251\t    - value\n1252\t    - CI_95\n1253\t    rows:\n1254\t    - - delta_NVE_trained_vs_untrained\n1255\t      - 1.8\n1256\t      - '[0.3, 3.2]'\n1257\t    - - exceedance_pct\n1258\t      - 72%\n1259\t      - '[55%, 88%]'\n1260\t    - - classification_accuracy_at_1.5x\n1261\t      - 71%\n1262\t      - '[55%, 85%'\n1263\t  figures_description:\n1264\t  - AUROC curves by environment + combined\n1265\t  - Bootstrap distribution of Δ NVE with CI overlay\n1266\t  analysis: Plan_034 的 worst 档结果对 methodology contribution 是关键的： NVE monitoring 有\n1267\t    some value（AUROC > random），但 environment-specific calibration requirement 削弱了\n1268\t    \"general diagnostic toolkit\" 的 pitch。 CoRL reviewer 需要 \"plug and play\" methodology，不是\n1269\t    \"first calibrate per-environment then use.\" Bootstrap CI includes 0.3 as lower\n1270\t    bound (barely positive) — the effect is real but small and unreliable.\n1271\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5000a456-2d73-46b2-bca6-48094b945ec7","uuid":"73e71407-626e-4c39-a79c-73fc006ebed9","timestamp":"2026-05-16T18:03:35.009Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_9/projects/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T172011/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '核心因果链（trained dt_emb → CIVO → collapse）作为 universal mechanism\n  不成立—— 可能是 Walker Walk + RSSM 的特异性现象，而非 imagination-based AC 的通用漏洞。 Reframe 方向（仍冲\n  CoRL）：从 \"mechanism paper\" 转为 \"methodology paper\"—— 贡献不是 CIVO 本身，而是 factorial diagnosis\n  + NVE monitoring + gradient decomposition 的诊断方法论。 关键失败点：Cheetah 控制实验 NVE > 2.0×（跨环境因果控制失败）；008f_s3\n  NVE > 1.5×（untrained dt_emb 保护被否证）； NVE 1.5× 阈值分类精度 < 75%。35pp decomposition 被 confound\n  with SGS side effects。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: Replicate delusional critic collapse with 2 more seeds (009e seed 1,\n    009b seed 2)\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_collapse: true\n    seed1_nve_peak: 4.12\n    seed1_nve_peak_step: 55000\n    seed1_eval_final_105K: 131\n    seed2_collapse: false\n    seed2_nve_peak: 2.05\n    seed2_nve_peak_step: 25000\n    seed2_eval_final_105K: 268\n    seed2_self_correction: true\n    collapse_rate: 0.5\n    nve_exceeds_1_5x_rate: 1.0\n  result_rationale: '已有数据（009e collapsed NVE 4.12×@55K; 009b self-corrected NVE 2.05×→0.38×）。\n    在 worst 档，这些结果本身成立，但 1/2 崩溃率意味着 CIVO 不是确定性的—— 仅是一个随机事件。当 Cheetah 的 dt_embed_dim=0\n    控制也出现 NVE>2.0× 时， Walker Walk 的 1/2 崩溃率变得不具说服力：究竟是 trained dt_emb 引起的， 还是配置组合的随机脆弱性？审稿人将质疑\n    n=2 的统计功效。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 008d cross-seed comparison\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - nve_peak\n    - nve_peak_step\n    - eval_105K\n    - collapse\n    - mechanism\n    rows:\n    - - 0(=009e)\n      - 4.12\n      - 55K\n      - 131\n      - true\n      - value-driven CIVO\n    - - 2(=009b)\n      - 2.05\n      - 25K\n      - 268\n      - false\n      - transient→self-correction\n  figures_description:\n  - 'NVE trajectory overlay: seed 0 accelerating to 4.12× vs seed 2 transient spike\n    then monotone decline'\n  analysis: '崩溃率 50% 在 worst 档下不足以支持 mechanism claim——reviewer 会说这是 \"coin flip\" 而非\n    \"reliable trigger\"。NVE>1.5× threshold 在 Walker Walk 内部仍有 4/4 separation， 但当 Cheetah\n    控制实验也出现高 NVE 时，这个 threshold 的跨环境泛化性崩溃。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: Replicate causal control stability — 008f_s3 (third seed) 是关键\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_009f_status: killed_no_data\n    seed2_009c_eval_105K: 148.34\n    seed2_009c_nve_105K: 1.14\n    seed3_008f_s3_eval_peak: 280\n    seed3_008f_s3_eval_105K: 165\n    seed3_008f_s3_nve_peak: 1.72\n    seed3_008f_s3_nve_peak_step: 85000\n    seed3_exceeds_1_5x: true\n    protection_falsified: true\n    classification_accuracy_post_s3: 0.71\n  result_rationale: 'Worst 档核心假设：008f_s3 NVE > 1.5×。机制：在 dt_embed_dim=0 条件下， RSSM\n    仍需处理 dt=2 transitions（subsample ON），reward head 无法区分 dt=1/dt=2 （reward gap 1.01×），但\n    observation decoder 的 dt=2 误差累积在某些 seed 下 仍可通过 critic 误导 actor。009c 已在 105K 达到\n    NVE=1.14×（borderline）， 008f_s3 在更长 run 或不同初始化下跨越 1.5×。这不是经典 CIVO（无 dt_emb amplification），\n    而是 \"raw RSSM fidelity gap\" 本身的有限 value overestimation——但它破坏了 NVE 1.5× 作为 trained\n    vs untrained dt_emb 的 perfect separator 的故事。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 008f (no dt_emb) all seeds NVE summary\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - nve_peak\n    - nve_peak_step\n    - exceeds_1.5x\n    - eval_105K\n    rows:\n    - - 0\n      - 1.02\n      - 25K\n      - false\n      - 503\n    - - 2(009c)\n      - 1.14\n      - 105K\n      - false\n      - 148\n    - - 3(008f_s3)\n      - 1.72\n      - 85K\n      - 'YES'\n      - 165\n  figures_description:\n  - 'NVE trajectory: three 008f seeds overlaid, with 1.5× threshold line — s3 crosses\n    threshold'\n  analysis: '008f_s3 跨越 NVE 1.5× 是 worst 档的核心打击点。此前 4/4 perfect separation （trained\n    2/2 exceed, untrained 0/2 exceed）变为 5/7 imperfect separation （trained 2/2+009e+009b=4/4\n    exceed, untrained 1/3 exceed = 008f_s3）。 分类精度从 100% 降至 ~71%（5/7 correct）。审稿人将质疑：如果没有\n    dt_emb 也能出现 NVE>1.5×，那么 trained dt_emb 真的是 \"necessary condition\" 吗？ 或仅是 \"amplifier\"？这削弱了整个\n    C2 因果链从 \"necessary and sufficient\" 到 \"risk factor\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 (mitigation) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_014\n  description: Multi-seed validation of dt=1 imagination mitigation\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_eval_105K: 869.9\n    seed1_nve_105K: 0.8\n    seed1_collapse: false\n    seed2_eval_105K: 137.0\n    seed2_nve_105K: 3.78\n    seed2_collapse: true\n    seed2_mechanism: eval_driven_not_CIVO\n    collapse_rate: 0.5\n    mitigation_reliability: unreliable\n  result_rationale: '已有数据确认（s1 成功 95% baseline, s2 崩溃 via non-CIVO pathway）。 在 worst\n    档，这个 50% 崩溃率与 008d 的 50% 完全相同——dt=1 imagination 作为 mitigation 零效果。更糟的是 s2 的崩溃机制（eval-driven,\n    entropy ↑） 与经典 CIVO 不同，被 reviewer 视为 \"ad hoc dual-pathway explanation\" 而非 genuine\n    insight。审稿人评价：\"claiming two distinct pathways from n=2 per pathway is unfalsifiable\n    post-hoc rationalization.\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 008e_v3 cross-seed collapse comparison\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - eval_105K\n    - nve_105K\n    - collapse\n    - pathway\n    - entropy_direction\n    rows:\n    - - 1\n      - 869.9\n      - 0.8\n      - false\n      - '-'\n      - stable\n    - - 2\n      - 137.0\n      - 3.78\n      - true\n      - Pathway B (eval-driven)\n      - ↑ -5.21→-3.83\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Dual-panel: s1 healthy monotone rise vs s2 late-onset collapse with diverging\n    entropy'\n  analysis: 'Dual-pathway 在 worst 档被视为 ad hoc。Reviewer 核心批评： \"Two pathways from two\n    seeds is curve-fitting, not science. Show me 10 seeds with clear bimodal distribution,\n    or this is just noise.\" 50% collapse rate means dt=1 imagination provides zero\n    marginal safety over dt=2 imagination (008d also 50%). The entire C6 story collapses\n    into \"trained dt_emb is bad, and we have no mitigation.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_013\n  description: Replicate value growth suppression with 2 more seeds\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_eval_105K: 520\n    seed1_nve_range:\n    - 0.55\n    - 0.95\n    seed1_collapse: false\n    seed1_recovery_pattern: single_dip_recovery\n    seed2_eval_105K: 380\n    seed2_nve_peak: 1.35\n    seed2_nve_peak_step: 75000\n    seed2_collapse: false\n    seed2_pattern: slow_decline_after_peak\n    cross_seed_consistency: moderate\n    vs_baseline_mean: -48%\n  result_rationale: '008a 的 \"untrained dt_emb\" 实际是 trained dt_emb unexposed to dt>1\n    data （subsample OFF = 所有训练数据都是 dt=1）。在 worst 档，seed 间变异大： seed 0 达到 778（85% baseline），但\n    seed 1/2 可能仅达到 380-520（40-57% baseline）。 V-recovery pattern 不稳定复现——有的 seed 单次\n    dip，有的缓慢下滑。 NVE 保持 <1.5× 但绝对性能远低于 baseline，reviewer 质疑： \"suppressed v/e is not\n    suppressed degradation — 008a still loses 48% performance, making it useless as\n    mitigation.\" 这削弱了 C3 从 \"protection\" 到 \"delayed failure\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 008a cross-seed summary\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - eval_105K\n    - vs_baseline_pct\n    - nve_peak\n    - collapse\n    - pattern\n    rows:\n    - - 0\n      - 778\n      - -15%\n      - 0.93\n      - false\n      - zigzag recovery\n    - - 1\n      - 520\n      - -43%\n      - 0.95\n      - false\n      - single dip recovery\n    - - 2\n      - 380\n      - -59%\n      - 1.35\n      - false\n      - slow decline post-peak\n  figures_description:\n  - Three-seed 008a eval curves showing high inter-seed variance; all below baseline\n    but no collapse\n  analysis: 'C3 核心 claim 是 \"untrained dt_emb prevents optimistic drift\" — 这在 worst\n    档仍成立 （NVE < 1.5×），但 practical value 被质疑。平均 -48% vs baseline 意味着 \"preventing collapse\n    by preventing learning\" — reviewer 评价： \"You''ve shown that removing information\n    prevents exploitation, which is trivially true.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk FROZEN dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=2 imag + H=8\n  plan_id: plan_015\n  description: Frozen dt_embedding (requires_grad=False), 诊断 dt_emb TRAINING 是否是必要条件\n  expected_results:\n    eval_105K: 204\n    nve_peak: 0.47\n    nve_105K: 0.42\n    collapse: false\n    actor_loss_105K: 0.000179\n    mechanism: gradient_starvation\n    gate_dt_mean: 2.0\n    comparison_vs_008d: no collapse but severe underperformance\n    comparison_vs_008f: similar non-collapse but different mechanism\n  result_rationale: '已有 exp_015b 数据：NVE 0.39-0.47（远低于 1.0，critic 低估），actor_loss→0\n    （gradient starvation），eval 80-238 高波动无稳定收敛。在 worst 档， 这个结果被 reviewer 视为 confounding：frozen\n    dt_emb 不崩溃是因为 gradient starvation 阻止了所有学习，不是因为 dt_emb training 是 CIVO 的原因。 \"You\n    prevented CIVO by preventing learning entirely — this doesn''t isolate the mechanism.\"\n    与 008f（dt_embed_dim=0）的区别不清晰：两者都不崩溃，但原因可能完全不同 （015b = gradient starvation; 008f\n    = no conditioning information）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Frozen dt_emb vs controls\n    columns:\n    - config\n    - eval_105K\n    - nve_peak\n    - mechanism\n    - informative_for_C2\n    rows:\n    - - 015b (frozen)\n      - 204\n      - 0.47\n      - gradient starvation\n      - confounded\n    - - 008d (trained)\n      - 131\n      - 4.12\n      - CIVO\n      - yes (positive control)\n    - - 008f (dim=0)\n      - 503\n      - 1.02\n      - no conditioning\n      - yes (negative control)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Three-way comparison: 008d collapse, 008f zigzag recovery, 015b flat low-performance'\n  analysis: '015b 在 worst 档被视为 uninformative control。Reviewer 评价： \"Freezing the embedding\n    creates a fundamentally different learning regime (gradient starvation in actor)\n    — you cannot conclude that training is the causal factor when your intervention\n    has multiple confounded effects.\" 2×2 消融矩阵（trained/frozen × exposed/unexposed）的\n    frozen row 全部被 gradient starvation 污染，无法干净解读。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 additional seeds (seed 3-4)\n  plan_id: plan_016\n  description: Narrow true collapse probability of dt=1 imagination config\n  expected_results:\n    seed3_eval_105K: 780\n    seed3_nve_105K: 0.72\n    seed3_collapse: false\n    seed4_eval_105K: 95\n    seed4_nve_peak: 4.2\n    seed4_nve_peak_step: 85000\n    seed4_collapse: true\n    seed4_mechanism: mixed — value and eval co-decline\n    total_collapse_rate: 2/4 = 50%\n    confidence_interval_collapse_rate: '[0.15, 0.85] (Clopper-Pearson 95%)'\n  result_rationale: 'Worst 档下，008e_v3 的崩溃率维持 ~50%（2/4 seeds collapse）。Seed 4 崩溃 机制既不完全像\n    Pathway A（value explosion）也不完全像 Pathway B（eval-driven）， 而是 \"mixed\" — 进一步削弱 dual-pathway\n    作为干净分类的可信度。 Clopper-Pearson 95% CI for 2/4 = [0.07, 0.93]，统计功效极低。 Reviewer 评价：\"50%\n    collapse from n=4 gives CI [0.07, 0.93] — you literally cannot distinguish this\n    from any collapse rate between 7% and 93%.\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 008e_v3 all seeds summary\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - eval_105K\n    - nve_105K\n    - collapse\n    - mechanism_classification\n    rows:\n    - - 1\n      - 869.9\n      - 0.8\n      - false\n      - healthy\n    - - 2\n      - 137.0\n      - 3.78\n      - true\n      - Pathway B (eval-driven)\n    - - 3\n      - 780\n      - 0.72\n      - false\n      - healthy\n    - - 4\n      - 95\n      - 4.2\n      - true\n      - mixed/ambiguous\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Four-seed overlay showing bimodal outcome: 2 converge ~800+, 2 collapse <150'\n  analysis: '50% collapse rate with wide CI is statistically uninformative. The existence\n    of a third mechanism pattern (seed 4 \"mixed\") destroys the dual-pathway narrative.\n    Reviewer 核心批评：\"每多一个 seed 就发明一条新 pathway — 这不是 mechanism discovery， 是 overfitting\n    to noise.\" CoRL 审稿标准要求 reproducible results，50% collapse from a supposedly safe\n    configuration is unacceptable for a practical recommendation.\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_020\n  description: dt=1 baseline in second DMC environment\n  expected_results:\n    seed0_eval_peak: 850\n    seed0_eval_500K: 820\n    seed1_eval_peak: 790\n    seed1_eval_500K: 760\n    seed2_eval_peak: 810\n    seed2_eval_500K: 780\n    mean_eval_500K: 787\n    std_eval_500K: 30\n    ve_stable_range: 0.65-0.75\n    baseline_established: true\n  result_rationale: 'Baseline 在任何 tier 下都应成功——这是 vanilla DreamerV3 on Cheetah Run。\n    已有 exp_010a 达到 849.8。Worst 档下 baseline 正常，cross-seed 一致性好， 建立了干净的 reference。这不是\n    failure point；failure 在后续实验。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cheetah baseline 3 seeds\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - eval_peak\n    - eval_500K\n    - ve_stable\n    rows:\n    - - 0\n      - 850\n      - 820\n      - 0.71\n    - - 1\n      - 790\n      - 760\n      - 0.68\n    - - 2\n      - 810\n      - 780\n      - 0.73\n  figures_description:\n  - Three-seed Cheetah baseline learning curves — consistent convergence to 760-820\n    range\n  analysis: 'Baseline 正常建立。为后续 CIVO trigger 和 causal control 提供 reference。 Cross-seed\n    std ~30 (3.8% of mean) 表明 Cheetah 的 seed sensitivity 低于 Walker Walk。\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_021\n  description: Replicate CIVO collapse in Cheetah Run\n  expected_results:\n    seed0_nve_peak: 8.5\n    seed0_nve_peak_step: 75000\n    seed0_collapse: true\n    seed0_eval_105K: 85\n    seed1_nve_peak: 5.2\n    seed1_nve_peak_step: 65000\n    seed1_collapse: true\n    seed1_eval_105K: 120\n    seed2_nve_peak: 3.8\n    seed2_nve_peak_step: 55000\n    seed2_collapse: false\n    seed2_eval_105K: 310\n    seed2_self_correction: true\n    collapse_rate: 2/3\n    mean_nve_peak: 5.83\n    cross_env_replication: partial\n  result_rationale: '已有 exp_010b 达到 NVE 14.59× 并崩溃。Worst 档下 CIVO trigger 仍部分成功 （2/3\n    collapse），但 peak NVE 范围 3.8-8.5×（低于 Walker Walk 的 009e 4.12× 仅作为下限）。关键问题不在 trigger（它\n    works），而在 control 不 work。 NVE 仍 >1.5× in all seeds，确认 trained dt_emb 确实 triggers\n    pathological overestimation。 但 severity 和 timing 跨环境不一致。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cheetah CIVO trigger 3 seeds\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - nve_peak\n    - peak_step\n    - eval_105K\n    - collapse\n    - vs_baseline_105K\n    rows:\n    - - 0\n      - 8.5\n      - 75K\n      - 85\n      - true\n      - -89%\n    - - 1\n      - 5.2\n      - 65K\n      - 120\n      - true\n      - -85%\n    - - 2\n      - 3.8\n      - 55K\n      - 310\n      - false\n      - -60%\n  figures_description:\n  - NVE trajectories for 3 Cheetah CIVO seeds, with Walker Walk 008d/009b overlay\n    for comparison\n  analysis: 'CIVO trigger 在 Cheetah 仍触发高 NVE，但 timing 和 severity 不同于 Walker Walk。\n    这本身不是 worst 档的核心问题——问题在于 control 也出现高 NVE。\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_022\n  description: 核心跨环境因果控制 — worst 档的关键失败点\n  expected_results:\n    seed0_nve_peak: 2.8\n    seed0_nve_peak_step: 75000\n    seed0_eval_105K: 280\n    seed0_exceeds_1_5x: true\n    seed1_nve_peak: 2.1\n    seed1_nve_peak_step: 85000\n    seed1_eval_105K: 350\n    seed1_exceeds_1_5x: true\n    seed2_nve_peak: 3.5\n    seed2_nve_peak_step: 65000\n    seed2_eval_105K: 190\n    seed2_exceeds_1_5x: true\n    seed2_collapse: true\n    mean_nve_peak: 2.8\n    all_exceed_1_5x: true\n    causal_control_failed: true\n    cheetah_control_nve_peak: 3.5\n  result_rationale: '这是 worst 档的核心破坏性结果。Cheetah 中去掉 dt_embedding 后 NVE 仍达 2.0-3.5×。\n    机制解释：Cheetah Run 的 reward landscape 比 Walker Walk 更稀疏（locomotion reward 与速度线性相关，但\n    early training 中 reward signal 噪声大），RSSM 在 Cheetah 中 即使没有 dt_emb conditioning，dt=2\n    transitions 的 reward prediction 偏差也足够 大，能通过 critic 产生显著 value overestimation。具体来说，Cheetah\n    的 reward_MAE at dt=2 即使无 dt_emb 也达到 baseline 的 3-5×（不像 Walker Walk 的 008f 的 75×\n    那么极端，但方向相同且 impact 不同）。这意味着 \"dt_embedding is necessary for CIVO\" 仅在 Walker Walk\n    成立——在 Cheetah 中，RSSM fidelity gap at dt=2 本身就足以 trigger pathological overestimation\n    without dt_emb amplification。因果链从 \"trained dt_emb → CIVO\" 变为 \"RSSM dt=2 error\n    → CIVO（dt_emb amplifies but is not necessary）\"。这是对 C2 核心 claim 的根本否证。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cheetah dt_embed_dim=0 — CONTROL FAILED\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - nve_peak\n    - peak_step\n    - eval_105K\n    - exceeds_1.5x\n    - collapse\n    rows:\n    - - 0\n      - 2.8\n      - 75K\n      - 280\n      - 'YES'\n      - false\n    - - 1\n      - 2.1\n      - 85K\n      - 350\n      - 'YES'\n      - false\n    - - 2\n      - 3.5\n      - 65K\n      - 190\n      - 'YES'\n      - true\n  - title: Cross-environment causal control comparison\n    columns:\n    - environment\n    - config\n    - seeds_exceeding_1.5x\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Walker Walk\n      - 008f (no dt_emb)\n      - 0/3\n      - control holds\n    - - Cheetah Run\n      - no dt_emb\n      - 3/3\n      - CONTROL FAILS\n    - - Walker Walk\n      - 008d (trained dt_emb)\n      - 2/2\n      - CIVO confirmed\n    - - Cheetah Run\n      - trained dt_emb\n      - 3/3\n      - CIVO confirmed\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cross-environment NVE comparison: Walker 008f (all <1.5×) vs Cheetah no-dt-emb\n    (all >1.5×)'\n  - 'Scatter plot: dt_embed_dim=0 NVE vs environment, showing environment-specific\n    behavior'\n  analysis: '核心灾难：在 Cheetah 中，去掉 dt_embedding 不能阻止 NVE>1.5×。 这直接否证了 \"trained dt_emb\n    is necessary for CIVO\" 作为跨环境通用规律。 可能的解释：Cheetah 的 RSSM fidelity gap 本身更大（不需要 dt_emb\n    放大）， 或者 Cheetah 的 reward structure 让 critic 更容易被 dt=2 误差误导。 无论哪种解释，都意味着 Walker\n    Walk 的干净 4/4 separation 是 environment-specific artifact。 NVE 1.5× threshold 不是\n    universal diagnostic marker for trained dt_emb — 它是 \"RSSM fidelity sufficient\n    for critic exploitation\" 的 marker， 而 dt_emb 仅在某些环境中是该条件的必要 amplifier。\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_023\n  description: Replicate value growth suppression in Cheetah Run\n  expected_results:\n    seed0_eval_105K: 450\n    seed0_nve_peak: 1.6\n    seed0_nve_105K: 1.2\n    seed1_eval_105K: 520\n    seed1_nve_peak: 1.4\n    seed1_nve_105K: 0.9\n    seed2_eval_105K: 380\n    seed2_nve_peak: 1.8\n    seed2_nve_105K: 1.5\n    mean_eval_105K: 450\n    vs_baseline_mean: -43%\n    seeds_exceeding_1_5x: 2/3\n    protection_partial: true\n  result_rationale: 'Subsample OFF + untrained dt_emb 在 Cheetah 中仅提供部分保护。 由于 Cheetah\n    的 RSSM fidelity gap 更大（见 plan_022 rationale）， 即使 dt_emb 未暴露于 dt>1 数据，RSSM 本身在处理环境动态时\n    产生的 compounding error 也会推高 value estimates。2/3 seeds 的 NVE 触及或超过 1.5×（虽然短暂），与\n    Walker Walk 008a 的 consistently <1.0× 形成鲜明对比。C3 的 \"untrained dt_emb prevents optimistic\n    drift\" 在 Cheetah 中不成立 — 再次说明现象的 environment-specificity。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cheetah untrained dt_emb (no subsample) 3 seeds\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - eval_105K\n    - nve_peak\n    - nve_105K\n    - vs_baseline\n    rows:\n    - - 0\n      - 450\n      - 1.6\n      - 1.2\n      - -43%\n    - - 1\n      - 520\n      - 1.4\n      - 0.9\n      - -34%\n    - - 2\n      - 380\n      - 1.8\n      - 1.5\n      - -52%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cheetah 008a-equivalent vs Walker 008a: NVE trajectories showing environment-dependent\n    suppression'\n  analysis: '在 worst 档，C3 的 value growth suppression 仅在 Walker Walk 干净复现。 Cheetah\n    中 untrained dt_emb 的保护力度显著减弱。这进一步支持 \"Walker Walk + RSSM 特异性\" 叙事 — CIVO 和 anti-CIVO\n    机制 都是 environment-specific 的，没有 universal pattern。\n\n    '\n- name: 'RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions'\n  plan_id: plan_030\n  description: Measure observation/reward reconstruction loss at dt=2 vs dt=1\n  expected_results:\n    cheetah_baseline_obs_gap: 3.2\n    cheetah_baseline_reward_gap: 2.8\n    cheetah_no_dt_emb_obs_gap: 3.8\n    cheetah_no_dt_emb_reward_gap: 1.8\n    cheetah_trained_dt_emb_obs_gap: 1.5\n    cheetah_trained_dt_emb_reward_gap: 3.9\n    walker_vs_cheetah_fidelity_pattern: inconsistent\n  result_rationale: 'Cheetah 的 RSSM fidelity pattern 与 Walker Walk 不同。关键差异： (1) Cheetah\n    baseline obs gap (3.2×) > Walker baseline (2.04×) — Cheetah 的 RSSM 在 dt=2 预测本身就更差。(2)\n    Cheetah no_dt_emb reward_gap (1.8×) 远高于 Walker 008f (1.01×) — 即使没有 dt_emb，Cheetah\n    的 reward 预测 在 dt=2 时仍有显著偏差。这解释了 plan_022 的失败：Walker 008f 的 reward gap 接近 1.0 使\n    critic 不被误导，但 Cheetah 的 1.8× reward gap 足以 trigger value overestimation without\n    dt_emb。RSSM fidelity analysis 揭示 核心问题不是 dt_emb training per se，而是 RSSM dt=2 reward\n    prediction quality — dt_emb 仅在 reward gap 本身低时才是关键 amplifier。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cross-environment RSSM fidelity comparison\n    columns:\n    - env\n    - config\n    - obs_gap\n    - reward_gap\n    - NVE_outcome\n    rows:\n    - - Walker\n      - baseline\n      - 2.04\n      - 1.56\n      - healthy\n    - - Walker\n      - 008d (trained dt_emb)\n      - 1.3\n      - 2.78\n      - CIVO collapse\n    - - Walker\n      - 008f (no dt_emb)\n      - 2.75\n      - 1.01\n      - no collapse\n    - - Cheetah\n      - baseline\n      - 3.2\n      - 2.8\n      - healthy\n    - - Cheetah\n      - trained dt_emb\n      - 1.5\n      - 3.9\n      - CIVO collapse\n    - - Cheetah\n      - no dt_emb\n      - 3.8\n      - 1.8\n      - NVE>2.0× (!)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Heatmap: reward_gap × obs_gap × collapse outcome, colored by environment'\n  analysis: 'RSSM fidelity analysis 在 worst 档下揭示一个关键 insight： CIVO 的 necessary condition\n    不是 trained dt_emb，而是 \"sufficient reward prediction error at dt>1 to mislead critic\"。dt_emb\n    在 Walker Walk 中是 这个条件的 sole enabler（008f reward_gap=1.01 without dt_emb），但在 Cheetah\n    中 RSSM 本身的 dt=2 reward error 就足够大（1.8× without dt_emb）。 这是 important methodological\n    finding 但破坏了 C2 的 clean causal story。\n\n    '\n- name: Actor entropy analysis\n  plan_id: plan_031\n  description: Plot actor_entropy vs training step for healthy vs collapsed configs\n  expected_results:\n    walker_008d_entropy_decline_rate: -0.035_per_1K_steps\n    walker_008e_v3_s2_entropy_rise_rate: +0.028_per_1K_steps\n    cheetah_collapsed_entropy_pattern: mixed\n    cheetah_no_dt_emb_collapsed_seed2_entropy: declining\n    pathway_classification_consistency: poor\n  result_rationale: 'Actor entropy analysis 在 worst 档下进一步混淆 mechanism classification。\n    Walker Walk 有干净的双模式（008d: entropy ↓ = CIVO Pathway A; 008e_v3_s2: entropy ↑ =\n    Pathway B）。但 Cheetah 的 collapsed seeds 不 fit 任何一种模式： 有的 entropy declining（像 Pathway\n    A），有的 flat（neither A nor B）， 有的 oscillating。这使得 \"dual-pathway\" framework 不能泛化到\n    Cheetah， 变成 Walker-Walk-specific phenomenology。审稿人评价： \"The pathway taxonomy is\n    descriptive, not predictive.\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Entropy trajectory classification across environments\n    columns:\n    - exp\n    - env\n    - collapse\n    - entropy_direction\n    - pathway_assignment\n    rows:\n    - - 008d_s0\n      - Walker\n      - true\n      - ↓ (-3.47→-4.88)\n      - A (CIVO)\n    - - 008e_v3_s2\n      - Walker\n      - true\n      - ↑ (-5.21→-3.83)\n      - B (eval-driven)\n    - - 010b\n      - Cheetah\n      - true\n      - ↓ (-4.2→-5.1)\n      - A-like\n    - - Cheetah_022_s2\n      - Cheetah\n      - true\n      - flat (-4.5→-4.4)\n      - unclassified\n    - - Cheetah_021_s0\n      - Cheetah\n      - true\n      - ↓ then ↑\n      - mixed\n  figures_description:\n  - Actor entropy trajectories for all collapsed experiments, colored by environment\n  analysis: 'Entropy-based pathway classification 在 Walker Walk 内部有 2/2 clean separation\n    但无法泛化。Cheetah 崩溃 seeds 的 entropy pattern 不落入 A/B 任一类别。 这支持 worst 档 narrative：现象是\n    environment-specific，不是 universal mechanism。\n\n    '\n- name: Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\n  plan_id: plan_032\n  description: Distribution plots of V(s) vs Monte Carlo return\n  expected_results:\n    walker_008d_value_overestimate_mean: +45%\n    walker_008d_value_overestimate_std: 22%\n    walker_008f_value_calibration_error: +8%\n    cheetah_no_dt_emb_value_overestimate_mean: +32%\n    cheetah_no_dt_emb_value_overestimate_std: 35%\n    distributional_test_p_value_walker: 0.001\n    distributional_test_p_value_cheetah_control: 0.02\n  result_rationale: 'Value distribution analysis 在 worst 档下确认：(1) Walker 008d 有显著\n    right-skewed value overestimation（如预期）；(2) Walker 008f calibration 良好； (3) 但 Cheetah\n    no_dt_emb 也有显著 overestimation（+32% mean）， 尽管 variance 更高。统计检验 p=0.02 对 Cheetah\n    control 仍显著， 意味着去掉 dt_emb 在 Cheetah 中不能恢复 value calibration。 这是 plan_022 结果的 distributional\n    确认。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Value calibration summary\n    columns:\n    - config\n    - env\n    - V(s) - MC_return mean%\n    - std_pct\n    - KS test p\n    rows:\n    - - 008d (trained dt_emb)\n      - Walker\n      - +45%\n      - 22%\n      - 0.001\n    - - 008f (no dt_emb)\n      - Walker\n      - +8%\n      - 15%\n      - 0.34\n    - - trained dt_emb\n      - Cheetah\n      - +52%\n      - 28%\n      - 0.001\n    - - no dt_emb\n      - Cheetah\n      - +32%\n      - 35%\n      - 0.02\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Violin plots: V(s) - MC_return distribution, 4 panels (Walker trained/untrained\n    × Cheetah trained/untrained)'\n  analysis: 'Distributional evidence 在 worst 档下强化了核心问题：Cheetah 的 no-dt-emb condition\n    不能恢复 value calibration（p=0.02 仍 significant）。 Calibration error +32% 虽然小于 trained\n    dt_emb 的 +52%，但仍足以 drive actor exploitation in 2/3 seeds。\n\n    '\n- name: dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\n  plan_id: plan_033\n  description: Analyze learned dt_embedding vectors evolution during training\n  expected_results:\n    walker_cosine_sim_dt1_dt2_initial: 0.85\n    walker_cosine_sim_dt1_dt2_35K: 0.42\n    walker_cosine_sim_dt1_dt2_55K: 0.28\n    cheetah_cosine_sim_dt1_dt2_35K: 0.38\n    cheetah_cosine_sim_dt1_dt2_55K: 0.22\n    divergence_rate_walker: -0.012_per_1K\n    divergence_rate_cheetah: -0.014_per_1K\n    cross_env_pattern: similar_divergence\n  result_rationale: 'dt_embedding cosine similarity 在两个环境中都快速下降——dt_emb 学会了区分 dt=1\n    和 dt=2。这在两个环境中一致，本身支持 \"dt_emb learns to condition\" 的故事。但在 worst 档下，这个 analysis\n    的问题是：cosine similarity divergence rate 在 Walker 和 Cheetah 中相似，但 outcome 不同（Walker\n    008f 不崩溃， Cheetah no_dt_emb 崩溃）。所以 dt_emb 的 learning dynamics 不是 environment-specific\n    outcome 的 predictor。这使得 cosine similarity 只是一个 descriptive metric，不具 diagnostic\n    value。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: dt_embedding cosine similarity evolution\n    columns:\n    - env\n    - step\n    - cos_sim_dt1_dt2\n    - CIVO_status\n    rows:\n    - - Walker\n      - 15K\n      - 0.72\n      - not yet\n    - - Walker\n      - 35K\n      - 0.42\n      - onset (008d)\n    - - Walker\n      - 55K\n      - 0.28\n      - collapse (008d)\n    - - Cheetah\n      - 15K\n      - 0.68\n      - not yet\n    - - Cheetah\n      - 35K\n      - 0.38\n      - onset\n    - - Cheetah\n      - 55K\n      - 0.22\n      - collapse\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cosine similarity curves: Walker and Cheetah overlaid, nearly identical divergence\n    rates'\n  analysis: 'Cosine similarity analysis 在 worst 档下成为 null result — 两个环境中 dt_emb 学习速度相似，但\n    outcome 差异来自 RSSM fidelity 差异，不是 dt_emb 本身。 This further supports the reframe:\n    dt_emb is an amplifier, not the root cause.\n\n    '\n- name: NVE threshold sensitivity analysis\n  plan_id: plan_034\n  description: Compute classification accuracy at various nve thresholds, 0 GPU cost\n  expected_results:\n    threshold_1_3x_accuracy: 0.64\n    threshold_1_5x_accuracy: 0.71\n    threshold_1_7x_accuracy: 0.79\n    threshold_2_0x_accuracy: 0.86\n    auroc_walker_only: 0.92\n    auroc_cross_environment: 0.68\n    optimal_threshold_walker: 1.5\n    optimal_threshold_cheetah: 2.5\n    threshold_stability: environment_dependent\n  result_rationale: '在 worst 档下，NVE threshold 分类在 Walker Walk 内部仍表现良好 （AUROC 0.92，1.5×\n    threshold 4/4 on original data），但加入 Cheetah 数据后 AUROC 降至 0.68。原因：(1) Cheetah no_dt_emb\n    的 3/3 seeds 都 exceed 1.5× = 3 false positives（被分类为 \"CIVO\" 但实际是 \"RSSM fidelity\n    gap without dt_emb\"）； (2) 如果加入 008f_s3 (NVE 1.72×) 作为 Walker Walk false positive，\n    则 Walker 内部 accuracy 也降至 5/7 = 71%。最佳 threshold 在环境间不一致 （Walker 1.5×, Cheetah\n    2.5×），使得 NVE threshold 不是 universal diagnostic tool 而是 environment-specific calibration。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: NVE threshold classification results\n    columns:\n    - threshold\n    - walker_accuracy\n    - cheetah_accuracy\n    - combined_accuracy\n    - notes\n    rows:\n    - - 1.3\n      - 5/7 (71%)\n      - 3/6 (50%)\n      - 8/13 (62%)\n      - too many FP\n    - - 1.5\n      - 5/7 (71%)\n      - 3/6 (50%)\n      - 8/13 (62%)\n      - 008f_s3 breaks Walker\n    - - 1.7\n      - 6/7 (86%)\n      - 4/6 (67%)\n      - 10/13 (77%)\n      - borderline\n    - - 2.0\n      - 7/7 (100%)\n      - 5/6 (83%)\n      - 12/13 (92%)\n      - excludes 008f_s3\n  - title: AUROC by scope\n    columns:\n    - scope\n    - auroc\n    - 95_pct_CI\n    rows:\n    - - Walker Walk only (original 4 seeds)\n      - 1.0\n      - '[0.75, 1.00]'\n    - - Walker Walk (with 008f_s3)\n      - 0.92\n      - '[0.70, 1.00]'\n    - - Cross-environment (Walker + Cheetah)\n      - 0.68\n      - '[0.45, 0.88]'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'ROC curves: Walker-only (solid, high AUC) vs cross-environment (dashed, poor\n    AUC)'\n  - 'Threshold sweep plot: accuracy vs threshold value, split by environment'\n  analysis: 'NVE threshold 的跨环境泛化失败是 worst 档的核心量化证据。 审稿人评价：\"A diagnostic marker that\n    requires environment-specific calibration is not a diagnostic marker — it''s a\n    fitted parameter. What does ''NVE>1.5× means CIVO'' add over ''model is broken''\n    which you can already see from eval decline?\" 论文需要承认 NVE threshold 是 Walker-Walk-calibrated，跨环境需要\n    re-calibration。 这削弱了 methodology paper 的 generality claim。\n\n    '\n- name: Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_050\n  description: dt=1 baseline in non-locomotion DMC environment\n  expected_results:\n    seed0_eval_peak: 820\n    seed0_eval_500K: 790\n    seed1_eval_peak: 800\n    seed1_eval_500K: 770\n    seed2_eval_peak: 835\n    seed2_eval_500K: 810\n    mean_eval_500K: 790\n    std_eval_500K: 20\n    ve_stable_range: 0.60-0.70\n    baseline_established: true\n  result_rationale: 'Cartpole Swingup 是非 locomotion 任务，DreamerV3 应正常收敛。 Baseline 在任何\n    tier 下都应成功。提供第三个环境的 reference。 ve_stable 略低于 Walker/Cheetah（Cartpole reward structure\n    不同）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cartpole baseline 3 seeds\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - eval_peak\n    - eval_500K\n    - ve_stable\n    rows:\n    - - 0\n      - 820\n      - 790\n      - 0.65\n    - - 1\n      - 800\n      - 770\n      - 0.62\n    - - 2\n      - 835\n      - 810\n      - 0.68\n  figures_description:\n  - Three-seed Cartpole baseline convergence curves\n  analysis: 'Cartpole baseline 正常。但在 worst 档下，后续实验（051/052）的结果 将进一步支持 \"environment-specific\n    phenomenon\" 叙事。\n\n    '\n- name: Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_051\n  description: Replicate CIVO collapse in Cartpole Swingup\n  expected_results:\n    seed0_nve_peak: 3.2\n    seed0_collapse: true\n    seed0_eval_105K: 150\n    seed1_nve_peak: 1.8\n    seed1_collapse: false\n    seed1_eval_105K: 420\n    seed2_nve_peak: 2.5\n    seed2_collapse: false\n    seed2_eval_105K: 350\n    seed2_self_correction: true\n    collapse_rate: 1/3\n    mean_nve_peak: 2.5\n  result_rationale: 'Cartpole 的 CIVO trigger 在 worst 档下仅 1/3 collapse。 NVE peaks 1.8-3.2×（低于\n    Walker 008d 的 4.12× 和 Cheetah 的 8.5×）。 Cartpole 的 reward 信号相对 dense（每 step 都有\n    meaningful reward difference）， 这使得 RSSM 在 Cartpole 的 reward prediction 质量更高，dt=2\n    error 更小。 结果：trained dt_emb 确实 raises NVE，但 collapse rate 更低且 severity 更弱。 Cross-environment\n    pattern：Walker 50% collapse, Cheetah 67%, Cartpole 33%。 没有一致的 collapse rate —\n    完全取决于 environment-specific RSSM fidelity。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cartpole CIVO trigger 3 seeds\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - nve_peak\n    - eval_105K\n    - collapse\n    - vs_baseline\n    rows:\n    - - 0\n      - 3.2\n      - 150\n      - true\n      - -81%\n    - - 1\n      - 1.8\n      - 420\n      - false\n      - -47%\n    - - 2\n      - 2.5\n      - 350\n      - false\n      - -56%\n  figures_description:\n  - Cartpole NVE trajectories showing lower peak severity than Walker/Cheetah\n  analysis: 'Cartpole 的低 collapse rate (1/3) 和低 NVE peaks 进一步支持 \"CIVO severity is\n    environment-specific\" 叙事。审稿人总结： \"Three environments, three different collapse\n    rates (33%, 50%, 67%) — the mechanism''s strength is entirely determined by environment\n    properties, not by the dt_emb architecture per se.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_052\n  description: Replicate causal control in Cartpole Swingup\n  expected_results:\n    seed0_nve_peak: 1.2\n    seed0_eval_105K: 550\n    seed0_exceeds_1_5x: false\n    seed1_nve_peak: 0.9\n    seed1_eval_105K: 620\n    seed1_exceeds_1_5x: false\n    seed2_nve_peak: 1.1\n    seed2_eval_105K: 580\n    seed2_exceeds_1_5x: false\n    all_below_1_5x: true\n    causal_control_holds: true\n  result_rationale: 'Cartpole 的 causal control 在 worst 档下 holds（all NVE < 1.5×）。 但这并不挽回整体叙事——它仅说明\n    Cartpole 像 Walker Walk 一样： no dt_emb → no CIVO。问题是 Cheetah 不 follow 这个 pattern。\n    跨环境总结：Walker control holds, Cartpole control holds, Cheetah control fails。 审稿人评价：\"2/3\n    environments support your causal control — but the one that doesn''t (Cheetah)\n    is actually the harder, more interesting environment. If your mechanism only works\n    on easy tasks, that''s a scope limitation, not a finding.\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cartpole dt_embed_dim=0 control\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - nve_peak\n    - eval_105K\n    - exceeds_1.5x\n    - vs_baseline\n    rows:\n    - - 0\n      - 1.2\n      - 550\n      - false\n      - -30%\n    - - 1\n      - 0.9\n      - 620\n      - false\n      - -21%\n    - - 2\n      - 1.1\n      - 580\n      - false\n      - -27%\n  - title: Cross-environment causal control summary\n    columns:\n    - environment\n    - control_holds (0/3 > 1.5×)\n    - environments_with_clean_replication\n    rows:\n    - - Walker Walk\n      - YES (0/3)\n      - 1\n    - - Cartpole Swingup\n      - YES (0/3)\n      - 1\n    - - Cheetah Run\n      - NO (3/3 > 1.5×)\n      - 0\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Environment comparison bar chart: control NVE peaks by environment'\n  analysis: '2/3 environments with clean replication 在 worst 档下不够。 Cheetah 是标准 DMC\n    benchmark 且 DreamerV3 论文中有 strong results， reviewer 不会接受 \"it works on Walker and\n    Cartpole but not Cheetah so we scope our claims\" — 因为 Cheetah 不是 outlier，而是 standard\n    task。 environments_with_clean_replication = 1（将 Cartpole 视为 \"similar to Walker\"，\n    计为同一类）或 2（如果按字面计数），取决于 reviewer 的 generosity。\n\n    '\n- name: Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot\n  plan_id: plan_060\n  description: Monitor RSSM prediction uncertainty; truncate when exceeding threshold\n  expected_results:\n    eval_105K: 380\n    nve_peak: 1.9\n    nve_105K: 1.4\n    collapse: false\n    vs_baseline: -59%\n    truncation_rate_dt2: 0.45\n    effective_horizon_mean: 5.8\n    uncertainty_threshold_sensitivity: high\n  result_rationale: 'Uncertainty-gated truncation 在 worst 档下\"部分 works\"——防止了 collapse\n    （NVE 未达到灾难性水平），但以大幅牺牲 effective horizon 为代价。 45% 的 dt=2 transitions 被截断，effective\n    horizon 从 H=8 降至 5.8， 导致 learning signal 不足，eval 仅 380（41% baseline）。 审稿人评价：\"Truncation\n    prevents collapse at the cost of making the model useless — you''re essentially\n    falling back to dt=1 with extra complexity. This is not a mitigation, it''s an\n    admission that dt>1 imagination doesn''t work.\" 更关键的是：uncertainty threshold 需要\n    per-environment calibration （与 NVE threshold 同样的问题），且对 threshold 值高度敏感。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Uncertainty truncation pilot results\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - value\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - eval_105K\n      - 380\n      - 41% baseline — worse than dt=1 config (008e_v3 95%)\n    - - nve_peak\n      - 1.9\n      - borderline — still approaches 1.5× danger zone\n    - - truncation_rate\n      - 45%\n      - nearly half dt=2 steps discarded\n    - - effective_H\n      - 5.8\n      - below H=8 target — learning signal loss\n    - - threshold_sensitivity\n      - high\n      - ±10% threshold change → ±25% eval change\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Eval trajectory with truncation rate overlay: as truncation increases, eval stabilizes\n    but stays low'\n  analysis: 'Plan_060 在 worst 档下确认了一个 negative insight：uncertainty truncation 是一种\n    overly conservative intervention，牺牲太多 learning signal。 它不构成 paper contribution——只是另一个\n    \"dt>1 不 work\" 的数据点。\n\n    '\n- name: Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\n  plan_id: plan_040\n  description: Third DMC environment for stronger generalization claim\n  expected_results:\n    baseline_mean_500K: 250\n    trained_dt_emb_collapse_rate: 1/3\n    trained_dt_emb_nve_peak_mean: 2.8\n    no_dt_emb_control_nve_peak_mean: 1.9\n    no_dt_emb_exceeds_1_5x: 2/3\n    control_failed: true\n    pattern: similar to Cheetah\n  result_rationale: 'Hopper Hop 是 hard locomotion task（DreamerV3 baseline 在 Hopper\n    上 本身就波动大）。在 worst 档下，Hopper 的结果类似 Cheetah： (1) CIVO trigger works（NVE 2.8× mean,\n    1/3 collapse）； (2) control fails（no_dt_emb 仍有 2/3 seeds exceed 1.5×）。 这进一步确认 \"causal\n    control 仅在 simple/smooth reward environments 成立\"。 Hopper 和 Cheetah 的共同特征：reward\n    landscape 更稀疏或更 nonlinear， RSSM fidelity gap at dt=2 更大，dt_emb 不再是 CIVO 的 sole\n    enabler。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Hopper results summary (worst tier)\n    columns:\n    - config\n    - collapse_rate\n    - mean_nve_peak\n    - control_holds\n    rows:\n    - - baseline\n      - 0/3\n      - 0.7\n      - '-'\n    - - trained_dt_emb\n      - 1/3\n      - 2.8\n      - '-'\n    - - no_dt_emb\n      - 0/3 collapse\n      - 1.9\n      - NO (2/3 > 1.5×)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Hopper learning curves: high variance even in baseline; hard to distinguish signal\n    from noise'\n  analysis: 'Hopper 数据在 worst 档下本身就 noisy（hard task, high variance）， 使得统计推断更困难。加上\n    control 失败，Hopper 不增加 paper 的说服力。 Final cross-environment tally: 4 environments\n    tested, causal control holds in 2 (Walker, Cartpole), fails in 2 (Cheetah, Hopper)。这是\n    50/50 — reviewer 不可能接受 \"the mechanism is universal\" with 50% replication。\n\n    '\n- name: NVE threshold sensitivity analysis (0 GPU)\n  plan_id: plan_034\n  description: Classification accuracy at various thresholds across all seeds\n  expected_results:\n    nve_threshold_classification_accuracy: 0.71\n    auroc_walker: 0.92\n    auroc_all_envs: 0.68\n    optimal_threshold_varies_by_env: true\n    walker_optimal: 1.5\n    cheetah_optimal: 2.5\n    cartpole_optimal: 1.7\n    hopper_optimal: 2.2\n    bootstrap_ci_delta_nve_lower_bound: 0.3\n    bootstrap_exceedance_pct: 72\n  result_rationale: 'NVE threshold 在 worst 档下仍有 some discriminative power（AUROC 0.68\n    > random）， 但远未达到 \"reliable diagnostic\" 水平。Classification accuracy 71% 意味着 ~30%\n    misclassification rate（both FP and FN）。Bootstrap CI lower bound 0.3 勉强 >0（方向对），但\n    exceedance 72% 远低于 95% CI 的 conventional threshold。 审稿人评价：\"A diagnostic with 30%\n    error rate and environment-specific thresholds is a starting point for methodology\n    research, not a finished contribution.\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cross-environment threshold analysis\n    columns:\n    - env\n    - optimal_threshold\n    - accuracy_at_1.5x\n    - AUROC\n    - n_datapoints\n    rows:\n    - - Walker\n      - 1.5\n      - 5/7 (71%)\n      - 0.92\n      - 7\n    - - Cheetah\n      - 2.5\n      - 5/6 (83%)\n      - 0.78\n      - 6\n    - - Cartpole\n      - 1.7\n      - 5/6 (83%)\n      - 0.89\n      - 6\n    - - Hopper\n      - 2.2\n      - 4/6 (67%)\n      - 0.72\n      - 6\n    - - ALL\n      - '-'\n      - 19/25 (76%)\n      - 0.68\n      - 25\n  - title: Bootstrap statistics (all environments)\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - value\n    - CI_95\n    rows:\n    - - delta_NVE_trained_vs_untrained\n      - 1.8\n      - '[0.3, 3.2]'\n    - - exceedance_pct\n      - 72%\n      - '[55%, 88%]'\n    - - classification_accuracy_at_1.5x\n      - 71%\n      - '[55%, 85%'\n  figures_description:\n  - AUROC curves by environment + combined\n  - Bootstrap distribution of Δ NVE with CI overlay\n  analysis: Plan_034 的 worst 档结果对 methodology contribution 是关键的： NVE monitoring 有\n    some value（AUROC > random），但 environment-specific calibration requirement 削弱了\n    \"general diagnostic toolkit\" 的 pitch。 CoRL reviewer 需要 \"plug and play\" methodology，不是\n    \"first calibrate per-environment then use.\" Bootstrap CI includes 0.3 as lower\n    bound (barely positive) — the effect is real but small and unreliable.\n","numLines":1271,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1271}}}
